window.__DOCSIFY_OFFLINE_DATA__ = {"content":{"html/_sidebar_使用说明.md":"- <a class=\"sidebar-group-link\" href=\"html/index_all.html\" data-folder=\"md\">**所有文档**</a>\n  - <a class=\"sidebar-group-link\" href=\"html/index_使用说明.html\" data-folder=\"md/使用说明\">**使用说明**</a>\n    - [快速开始](/md/使用说明/快速开始.md)\n    - [绘图示例](/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md)\n","md/使用说明/快速开始.md":"# 快速开始\n\n欢迎使用 md2web。把 Markdown 放进 `docs/md/`，运行构建脚本即可生成完全离线的文档站。\n\n## 阅读区工具栏\n\n每篇文档右上角都有一排按钮：\n\n- **复制链接**：复制当前页面的链接地址（含 `#/` 路由，可直接分享给他人）\n- **复制 SVN 链接**：当前文档属于已配置 SVN 仓库时显示，复制仓库地址与文档相对路径\n- **编辑 MD**：打开双栏编辑器——左侧 Markdown 源码按格式分色（标题层级、列表、代码块、公式），右侧实时预览（Mermaid、PacketDiag、KaTeX 公式、代码高亮）；左侧固定大纲导航默认显示，点击章节会同时把源码与预览定位到该处；支持撤销/恢复（`Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Y`）、上传本地图片与附件、文字颜色与表格行列选择器；登录后 `Ctrl+S` 保存**个人草稿**（带版本号，不会直接改动站点），在编辑器里「提交 SVN」后才写回仓库\n- **下载 MD**：下载当前页面对应的 Markdown 源文件\n- **下载本页**：把当前文档导出为自包含 HTML（含图片、图形与目录，可离线转发）\n- **宽屏阅读** / **隐藏序号**：切换阅读布局与标题编号\n\n编辑器常用快捷键：`Ctrl+B` 加粗 · `Ctrl+I` 斜体 · `Ctrl+K` 链接 · `Ctrl+M` 行内公式 · `Ctrl+Shift+M` 公式块 · `Ctrl+Alt+1/2/3` 标题 · `Ctrl+Shift+U`/`Ctrl+Shift+O` 无序/有序列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+K` 任务列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+C` 代码块 · `Ctrl+Shift+G` Mermaid · `Ctrl+Shift+D` PacketDiag · `Ctrl+Shift+T` 表格行列 · `Ctrl+Alt+K` 文字颜色 · `Ctrl+Shift+H` 大纲导航 · `Ctrl+S` 保存草稿 · `Ctrl+Shift+S` 另存为 · `Ctrl+/` 全部快捷键。\n\n> 草稿与提交需要登录认证服务（`python serve.py`）；局域网其他机器访问时同样可以登录编辑，权限由所在仓库的「允许合入 / 允许在线修改」开关决定；`file://` 双击模式为离线只读，编辑器只能下载或保存到本地文件。\n\n左侧栏顶部还有「绘图预览」入口（<a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lib/plot-playground.html</a>），可在线试写 Mermaid / PacketDiag 并下载图片。\n\n## AI 助手\n\n右下角「AI 助手」按钮（或 `Ctrl+Shift+A`）打开对话面板：它会先在本地 `search-index.json` 中检索相关章节，再把资料片段与问题一起发给您配置的大模型，回答下方列出引用来源，点击即可跳转。\n\n配置入口在**左侧栏顶部的 `AI 配置` 图标**（对话面板右上角「⚙ 配置」同样可打开），包含：\n\n- **服务商与密钥**：OpenAI 兼容 / DeepSeek / Ollama 本机 / Anthropic / 自定义，填写接口地址、模型、API Key、温度、系统提示与请求方式，点「保存并测试」验证连通性\n- **资料范围**：按文件夹/文档勾选，回答只依据所选资料（不勾选 = 使用全部文档）\n- **上传文档**：可选择本机的 `.md` / `.markdown` / `.txt` 加入检索（单个 ≤ 256 KB、合计 ≤ 512 KB，仅保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会上传或提交到仓库）；上传文档会出现在资料范围的「upload://」分组中\n- API Key 只保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会写入仓库或上传服务端；公开仓库请勿把 Key 提交进任何文件\n- 请求方式默认「自动」：浏览器直连失败（通常是跨域）时自动改走本机 `serve.py` 的 `/__ai/chat` 代理（仅本机可调用）\n- 完全离线（双击 `index.html`）时检索仍可用，但调用模型需要网络，且只能直连、不能走本机代理\n- 快捷动作：「总结本页」「文档概览」「解释选中」（选中正文文字后点击）\n\n## 数学公式\n\n行内公式用 `$...$`，独立公式块用 `$$...$$`，由 KaTeX 离线渲染：\n\n行内：$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\n\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-x^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$\n\n## 目录约定\n\n- `docs/md/` 是唯一需要维护的目录，可自由创建子文件夹\n- 图片无需登记，放在文档旁边或任意位置，用相对路径引用即可，例如 `![](images/flow.png)`；编辑器上传的图片会保存到文档同级 `images/`\n- 附件放在文档同级 `附件/`，编辑器「上传附件」会自动插入 `[文件名](附件/文件名)` 链接\n- 构建只处理 `.md` 文档；图片与附件由浏览器直接加载\n\n## 构建与预览\n\n```\npython setup_docsify.py\npython serve.py\n```\n\n也可以直接双击 `docs/index.html` 浏览（file:// 模式）：`docs` 根目录只保留总览页 `index.html`，其余页面与数据在 `docs/html/`；点总览里的文件夹卡片进入 `docs/html/index_<文件夹>.html`，每个入口页都内嵌了 Markdown 与搜索快照，离线只读，保留搜索、图形、公式与下载能力。\n\n## 登录与编辑权限\n\n默认 `python serve.py` 启动**认证编辑服务**（匿名可读、登录后可编辑）；`python serve.py --preview` 是只读预览，不提供任何写接口。\n\n```\npython3 -m pip install --user --no-index --find-links server/wheels -r server/requirements.txt   # 离线包（推荐；非 root 加 --user）\npython3 -m pip install --no-index --find-links server/wheels -r server/requirements.txt            # 离线包（有写权限的账号）\npython3 -m pip install -r server/requirements.txt                                                  # 或联网安装（仅服务机需要）\npython3 serve.py                                     # Linux 推荐用 python3（3.6.8+ 全功能）\npython serve.py                                      # Windows / 默认启动认证编辑服务（配置不存在会自动生成）\npython serve.py --preview                            # 只读预览（无写接口）\npython serve.py --bind 127.0.0.1                      # 仅本机访问（默认监听所有网卡，局域网可访问）\n./start_linux.sh                                   # Linux：默认后台启动（日志 data/serve.log）\n./start_linux.sh --stop                            # 停止后台实例（按 pidfile）\n./start_linux.sh --restart                         # 强制重启：先 git pull --ff-only 更新代码，再结束占用端口的进程后启动\n./start_linux.sh --update                          # 启动前更新代码（仓库有新版功能时用它）\n./start_linux.sh --update --no-update              # 跳过代码更新（等价 MD2WEB_NO_UPDATE=1）\nMD2WEB_GIT_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7890 ./start_linux.sh --restart   # 网络受限（直连 github 被重置）时走代理更新\nMD2WEB_UPDATE_ONLY=1 ./start_linux.sh --update     # 只更新代码不启动（配合部署脚本）\nsh start_linux.sh                                   # 若报 No such file or directory（CRLF/权限）：用 sh 运行可自动去 CR\nsed -i \"s/\\r$//\" start_linux.sh && chmod +x start_linux.sh   # 或手动修复后继续用 ./start_linux.sh\n./start_linux.sh --status                          # 查看状态与进程（md2web-serve）\n./start_linux.sh --foreground                      # 前台运行（Ctrl+C 停止）\n```\n\n> 重启/更新说明：`start_linux.sh` 只运行**当前工作区**的代码，不会自动同步远端。`--restart` 与 `--update` 会先 `git pull --ff-only` 再启动（前端生成物随提交同步，因此通常无需额外构建；`--rebuild` 可强制重建站点）。服务运行时会自动重建 `docs/`，这些生成物的本地改动会先还原、拉取后按本机配置重建，不会挡住更新。更新失败时只打印警告并继续用现有代码启动，常见原因是 `docs/` 之外的未提交改动、部署目录不是 git 工作副本，或直连 github.com 被重置——按提示走代理或先手动 `git pull`。\n\n局域网访问：服务默认监听所有网卡，启动日志会打印「局域网访问: http://<服务器IP>:8882」，同事直接用该地址即可打开；打不开时先放行防火墙端口：RHEL/CentOS 7 执行 `sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=8882/tcp --permanent && sudo firewall-cmd --reload`，Ubuntu 执行 `sudo ufw allow 8882/tcp`（启动时会检测 firewalld/ufw 并提示）。**机器有多个 IP、只有部分 IP 能打开**时按顺序查三点：① 监听地址——`ss -lntp | grep 8882` 必须是 `0.0.0.0:8882`，若显示某个具体 IP 说明 `--bind`/配置 `server.bind` 把它限死了（改成 `0.0.0.0`）；② 地址类型——只有物理网卡（`eth0`/`ens33`/`bond0`）的地址才能从外部访问，`docker0`、`virbr0`、`tun`/`br-*` 等虚拟网卡地址外部没有路由；③ firewalld 按 zone 绑网卡——`sudo firewall-cmd --get-active-zones` 列出多个 zone 时**每个 zone 都要放行**（`sudo firewall-cmd --zone=<zone> --add-port=8882/tcp --permanent && sudo firewall-cmd --reload`），只放默认 zone 会导致另一个网卡的 IP 打不开。启动横幅会列出全部可用地址并标注虚拟网卡；只监听单个 IP 时会直接提示哪些地址打不开。只允许本机使用时用 `--bind 127.0.0.1`。局域网内任何人都能看到登录页与文档，请务必修改默认管理员密码。\n\n启动后刷新页面：\n\n1. 侧栏顶部「设置」→ 用管理员账号登录（首次为 **admin / admin**，登录后请立即在窗口底部修改密码）。\n2. 在「SVN 认证路径」填入管理员准备的路由（必须是**强制账号密码认证**的路径，可点「测试认证路径」验证；允许匿名访问的路径会被拒绝）。\n3. 在「仓库映射」中填写 docs 目录与 SVN 地址（按目录段最长前缀匹配，如 `md/硬件设计` → hardware 库）。\n4. 在「默认同步凭据（SVN 账号）」中填入统一的 SVN 同步账号/密码（保存前会用认证路径校验并加密入库）：没有单独配置凭据的仓库同步时统一使用它；某个仓库需要不同账号时，在它的明细行里填写「同步账号 / 密码」并点「保存凭据」，该凭据优先于默认凭据。\n5. 按需填写「AI 助手」默认值（接口地址/模型/Key，会下发给所有登录用户），保存即可生效，无需重启。\n\n管理员打开「设置」还能看到**使用情况**（按 IP/账号的登录记录、账号使用量、用户总数、详细操作记录）与**文档统计**（每个文档的大小/更新时间/更新次数、文件夹大小、文档增删记录，点击表头可排序）。\n\n「设置 → 仓库映射」可为每个文件夹分别设置 SVN 库与**更新频率（秒）**：服务会按频率自动拉取远端更新；正在编辑（有草稿）的文档不会被覆盖，编辑器会提示先合并并可查看「远端差异」，提交成功后展示本次差异。\n\n编辑器左侧目录默认显示，点击章节会同时把源码与右侧预览定位到该处；「设置」窗口按 AI 助手 / SVN 与仓库 / 账号 / 信息查询 分 Tab 显示。\n提交时会把文档里引用的 `images/` 图片与 `附件/` 文件一起存档到 SVN（审阅面板会列出将一并提交的图片与附件）。\n\n仓库与站点结构：`docs` 根目录只保留总览页 `index.html`，其余页面与数据都在 `docs/html/`——每个文件夹一个入口页 `html/index_<文件夹或仓库名>.html`（独立搜索索引；只读/禁止合入的仓库不能提交），`html/index_all.html` 为全部文档合并视图；仓库配置在 `html/md2web_config.html`（管理员登录后可改地址、目录映射、更新频率、分组与权限，可在「默认同步凭据」统一设置同步账号或按仓库单独保存凭据，并可用「创建并拉取」自动创建目录并下载 SVN 内容）。\n\n之后：\n\n- 匿名读者仍可浏览、搜索、下载；docsify 文档页在侧栏显示「登录」，总览/配置/反馈/回收站/绘图预览等独立页在右上角显示固定的「登录」入口。\n- 编辑者用**自己的 SVN 账号密码**登录（服务端通过认证路径验证；口令先校验，成功后以本机密钥加密保存在服务端数据库，提交与查询直接复用，换密码后重新登录会自动更新；旧版 svn 客户端会回退到命令行参数传口令）。\n- 登录后打开编辑器，`Ctrl+S`（或「保存」按钮）按文档是否有 SVN 库区分：\n  - **没有 SVN 库**（所在文件夹未配置仓库，或配置为本地模式）：按钮显示「**保存到服务器**」，一步把内容写入 `docs/md` 并重建站点，关闭编辑器后页面自动刷新即可看到更新；服务器上的文件被外部改动时会提示冲突并拒绝覆盖。\n  - **有 SVN 库**：按钮显示「**本地暂存**」——保存的是带版本号的个人草稿（其他标签页或本人更新会让旧版本保存返回冲突，不会覆盖），只存在本机服务器、不会写 SVN；工具条提供「历史」（草稿版本列表，可载入任一版本）、「差异」（已发布版本 ↔ 当前草稿的统一差异）、「载入最新」「放弃草稿」。确认无误后点「**提交 SVN**」写入仓库。\n- **离开提醒**：只要还有未提交 SVN 的本地暂存（草稿），或编辑器里有未保存的修改，关闭/刷新/离开网页时浏览器会弹确认，避免辛苦编辑的内容丢失。\n- **插入图片 / 上传附件**：工具栏「上传图片」「上传附件」可多选文件，也可在源码区直接 `Ctrl+V` 粘贴剪贴板图片、把文件拖入编辑器（图片自动走 `images/`，其他文件走 `附件/`）。登录后图片保存到**当前文档同目录的 `images/`**（命名 `<文档名>-<时间戳>-<序号>.<扩展名>`）并插入引用，附件保存到同目录的 `附件/`（沿用原文件名、重名加序号）并插入 `[文件名](附件/文件名)`；`file://` 离线模式改为内嵌 data URL 或下载。\n- **文字颜色与表格**：`Ctrl+Alt+K` 打开颜色面板（生成 `<span style=\"color:…\">`，预览与站点都生效）；`Ctrl+Shift+T` 用行列选择器插入 1–8 行列的表格。\n- **查找与替换**：源码区 `Ctrl+F` 打开查找、`Ctrl+H` 打开替换；支持**大小写敏感 / 整词 / 正则**，显示命中计数，`Enter` / `F3` 跳到下一个（`Shift+Enter` / `Shift+F3` 上一个），「全部替换」一次完成，替换结果可用 `Ctrl+Z` 撤销。\n- **没有 SVN 库也能保存**：所在目录未关联仓库或为本地模式时，用「保存到服务器」直接写回 `docs/md`（草稿仅用于有 SVN 库的文档）；有 SVN 库时提交 SVN 会把新文件加入仓库。\n- **提交 SVN**：编辑器右上角「提交 SVN…」→ 填写提交说明 → 审阅面板显示目标库、精确文件与统一差异 → 点「确认提交」用**自己的 SVN 账号**提交；成功后站点会自动重建。提交只包含这篇文档，不会夹带其他文件夹或其他人的改动；远端基线过期时会明确报错而不是覆盖。「SVN 日志」可按当前账号查看目标库日志。\n- **管理员**使用本机账号（默认 `admin / admin`）登录后同样可以本地编辑；提交时提示输入一次 SVN 账号，验证通过后会加密保存到服务端数据库，后续提交可复用。\n- 会话默认 8 小时有效、闲置 30 分钟失效；服务重启后需重新登录。\n- 写接口全部经过登录 + CSRF 校验；源文件写回使用版本校验，不再有\"再次保存强制覆盖\"。\n- 修改 SVN 认证路径会让已有 SVN 用户会话失效（管理员会话保留以便继续配置）。\n\n> 阶段一（登录与只读边界）、阶段二（个人草稿、版本历史、差异）与阶段三（多库提交、私有工作副本、外部同步）已实现。工程师生成本地编辑与 SVN 提交的习惯不受影响，网站也不采集本地编辑过程。\n\n## 读者反馈\n\n侧栏 AI 设置图标旁有**反馈图标**（没有该图标的页面显示右上角固定「反馈」按钮），点击弹出反馈窗口；也可以直接打开 `html/md2web_feedback.html`：\n\n- 登录账号的读者可提交问题：标题 + 问题描述 + 相关页面；**可直接粘贴截图（`Ctrl+V`）**，或拖入/选择图片与附件——截图保存到 `docs/html/images/`、附件保存到 `docs/html/uploads/`，提交后的卡片里可直接预览缩略图、点开原图与下载附件\n- 未登录只能查看；作者本人可删除自己提交的反馈，管理员可删除任意一条并更新处理进度（待处理 / 处理中 / 已解决 / 已关闭）与处理说明，列表按状态着色\n- 反馈需要认证服务（`python serve.py`）；`file://` 离线打开只能查看，不能提交\n\n## 界面小技巧\n\n- 阅读区右上角的按钮行（复制链接 / 查看源码 / 编辑 MD / 下载 MD / 下载本页 / 显示序号）在向下滚动时会**固定在顶部**。\n- 「查看源码」无需登录：弹出窗口直接显示当前文档的 Markdown 源码，可编辑、实时预览，并「保存到本地」（不会改动服务端文档）。\n- 从搜索结果进入阅读模式时，命中工具条与按钮行会上下并排显示，互不遮挡；离开阅读模式后按钮行回到顶部。\n- 右侧「本文目录」固定**贴着窗口右缘**；其左边缘是可用鼠标拖动的调节线，向左拖变宽、向右拖变窄（宽度记忆在本机，刷新后保持）。\n- 搜索框放大镜右侧的 ⚙ 图标用于展开/收起「范围 / 模式 / 仓库」筛选（默认收起节省空间，筛选生效时图标高亮）。「仓库」是**多选**菜单：勾选一个或多个仓库后，搜索只在这些仓库里进行（可「全选/清空」，选择记忆在本机）；它与「范围」「模式」叠加生效。\n- 导出的独立 HTML 中，本文目录固定在**左侧导航**，正文在右侧滚动。目录会**高亮当前阅读的章节**并自动展开其上级；右上角有「隐藏」按钮，隐藏后屏幕右缘会出现「目录」小标签，点击即可恢复。分级标题左侧的箭头可折叠/展开子章节。\n- 绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可把左侧源码一键复制回文档；绘图示例中的每个图形都配有源码对照。\n- AI 助手面板：上传文档入口在**输入框上方**（不在配置弹窗里）；「历史」可查看与切换本机保存的历史对话，「新对话」开始一份新记录。\n- 设置入口：侧栏顶部 HOME 图标旁的单个「设置」图标（含 AI 配置）。窗口内可配置：**我的 AI 设置**（服务商/接口/模型/Key/代理策略/**参考源码路径**/资料范围，仅存本机浏览器）、**服务端设置**（管理员登录后配置 SVN 认证路径、仓库映射与全站 AI 默认值）、管理员改密。\n- 反馈入口：侧栏「设置」图标旁的反馈图标，点击弹出反馈窗口（提交问题、粘贴截图、上传附件、查看进度）；配置页/总览页等没有侧栏的页面在右上角显示固定的「反馈」按钮。\n- 文件夹视图右键菜单：在 `html/index_all.html` 的文件夹条目上右键可新建文档/新建文件夹/重命名/**移动到…**/删除（移入 `data/trash`，可找回）与设置分组（管理员）。左侧导航同样可以右键：分组标签带着真实目录，**空文件夹也会显示**，新建的子文件夹可直接右键在其中继续新建文档/子文件夹，不会落到别的目录里。\n- 文档分组与移动：来自子文件夹的文档在列表里按文件夹分组，组标题显示文件夹路径与配置分组（子文件夹继承上级仓库的分组）。「移动到…」弹窗选择本仓库内的目标文件夹（跨仓库不允许）；移动会带上该文档引用的 `images/`、`附件/` 文件——只被本文档引用就移动，被同目录其他文档也引用则保留原件并在目标目录复制一份，目标目录已有同名且内容不同的资源会跳过并提示。\n- 管理员登录：**本机管理员账号（默认 `admin / admin`）不需要 SVN 校验**，用页面右上角「登录」或设置窗口即可登录；侧栏会显示「管理员（本机）」。本机账号只能**本地编辑与保存草稿**；「提交 SVN…」时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号（仅本次合入使用，留在服务进程内存），因为仓库写入始终以真实 SVN 身份记录。\n- 首页（`#/`）由构建生成，编辑器只提供只读预览并提示改从左侧目录打开 `docs/md` 下的文档；文档路由不带 `.md`（docsify 会去掉后缀）也能正常编辑与保存。\n- 「参考源码路径」会随提问一起发给模型（如 `D:/repo/firmware` 或 `/srv/src/project`），便于 AI 回答时引用代码库位置。\n\n## 代码高亮\n\n```python\nprint(\"hello md2web\")\n```\n\n## Mermaid 图形\n\n围栏语言写 `mermaid` 即渲染为图形（离线本地渲染）：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[编写 Markdown] --> B[运行构建]\n  B --> C[离线浏览与搜索]\n```\n","md/使用说明/绘图示例.md":"# 绘图示例\n\n本文给出文档站支持的**全部绘图样例**：27 种 Mermaid 图形类型与 11 个 PacketDiag 模板，每个都提供「效果 + 源码」对照。源码可直接复制到 <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a> 中修改后再贴回文档。\n\n## Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）\n\n### 1. flowchart 流程图\n\n语法要点：节点 A[文本]、判断 B{条件}、子图 subgraph\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n```\n\n### 2. sequenceDiagram 时序图\n\n语法要点：participant 参与者、->> 请求、-->> 响应\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n```\n\n### 3. classDiagram 类图\n\n语法要点：class 类、+属性/+方法、<|-- 继承\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n```\n\n### 4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图\n\n语法要点：[*] 起止状态、A --> B: 事件\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n```\n\n### 5. erDiagram ER 图\n\n语法要点：实体 ||--o{ 关系 : 标签、属性块\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n```\n\n### 6. journey 用户旅程\n\n语法要点：section 阶段、任务: 评分: 角色\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n```\n\n### 7. gantt 甘特图\n\n语法要点：dateFormat、section、任务: 状态, id, 开始, 时长\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n```\n\n### 8. pie 饼图\n\n语法要点：pie title、\"标签\" : 数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n```\n\n### 9. quadrantChart 四象限\n\n语法要点：x-axis/y-axis、quadrant-1..4、数据点 [x, y]\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n```\n\n### 10. requirementDiagram 需求图\n\n语法要点：requirement { id/text/risk/verifymethod }、element、关系；文本值需加引号\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n```\n\n### 11. gitGraph 提交图\n\n语法要点：commit、branch、checkout、merge\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n```\n\n### 12. mindmap 思维导图\n\n语法要点：root((中心)) 与缩进层级\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n```\n\n### 13. timeline 时间线\n\n语法要点：标题、时间 : 事件 : 事件\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n```\n\n### 14. sankey 桑基图\n\n语法要点：CSV 三列：来源,目标,数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n```\n\n### 15. xychart XY 图\n\n语法要点：x-axis 分类、y-axis 范围、bar/line 数据\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n```\n\n### 16. block 块图\n\n语法要点：columns 列数、块定义、--> 连线\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n```\n\n### 17. packet 报文图\n\n语法要点：packet-beta、位范围: \"字段\"\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n```\n\n### 18. architecture 架构图\n\n语法要点：group/service(icon)[标题]、:L -- R: 连线\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n```\n\n### 19. C4 上下文图\n\n语法要点：Person/System/Rel 声明\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n```\n\n### 20. kanban 看板\n\n语法要点：列[标题] 与缩进任务[描述]\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n```\n\n### 21. radar 雷达图\n\n语法要点：axis id[\"维度\"]、curve id[\"名称\"]{数值}、max 上限\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n```\n\n### 22. treemap 矩形树图\n\n语法要点：层级标题 + \"叶子\": 数值\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n```\n\n### 23. wardley 战略图\n\n语法要点：anchor/component 名称 [可见度, 演进度]、-> 依赖（名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n```\n\n### 24. cynefin 决策域\n\n语法要点：complex/complicated/clear/chaotic/confusion 与条目\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n```\n\n### 25. eventmodeling 事件建模\n\n语法要点：tf 序号 类型 名称（ui/cmd/evt/readmodel 等，名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n```\n\n### 26. treeView 目录树\n\n语法要点：treeView-beta 与缩进层级（带 / 为目录）\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n```\n\n### 27. info 版本信息\n\n语法要点：仅显示 Mermaid 版本\n\n效果：\n\n```mermaid\ninfo\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\ninfo\n```\n\n> 未包含的实验类型（如 `venn`、`ishikawa`、`railroad-*`、`flowchart-elk`）在当前 Mermaid 版本下不稳定或需要额外插件，绘图预览页的下拉框中亦未收录。\n\n## PacketDiag 报文图\n\n围栏语言写 `packetdiag`，使用标准 [packetdiag](http://blockdiag.com/en/nwdiag/packetdiag-examples.html) 语法；字段格式为 `bit[-end]: 标签 [选项]`。\n\n### 1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 2. TCP 头部（tcp）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 4. UDP 头部（udp）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n```\n\n### 6. 标准示例（standard）\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n### 7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n```\n\n### 8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n```\n\n### 9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n```\n\n### 10. 扩展：desctable 描述表\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 11. 扩展：字段属性演示\n\n效果：\n\n```packetdiag\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n```\n\n源码：\n\n```text\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n```\n\n### 常用选项\n\n| 选项 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `color` | 填充色 | `[color = \"#dbeafe\"]` |\n| `textcolor` | 文字色 | `[textcolor = \"red\"]` |\n| `rotate` | 标签旋转 90/270 | `[rotate = 270]` |\n| `colheight` | 高度倍数 1–12 | `[colheight = 3]` |\n| `label` | 显示名 | `[label = \"Src Port\"]` |\n| `description` | 生成字段说明表 | `[description = \"RFC 793\"]` |\n| `style` | 边框样式 | `[style = \"dashed\"]` |\n\n### 全局配置与增强语法\n\n| 语法 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `colwidth = 32;` | 每列宽度 |\n| `node_height = 48;` | 行高 |\n| `default_fontsize = 12;` | 默认字号 |\n| `scale_interval = 10;` | 位标尺间隔 |\n| `numbering = \"global\"` / `\"local\"` | 全局编号 / 按行编号 |\n| `bit_order = \"desc\"` | 位序反转（配合升序范围使用） |\n| `// @row: 名称` | 按行分段标题 |\n| `// @left: 文本` | 左侧注释 |\n| `desctable { 名称 = \"说明\" }` | 字段说明表 |\n\n> 图形均可点击放大查看；Mermaid 支持下载 SVG / PNG，PacketDiag 支持下载 PNG。绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可一键把源码复制回文档；阅读区右上角的「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML 文件。\n"},"searchIndex":{"/":{"/?id=gt文档知识库":{"slug":"/?id=gt文档知识库","title":"GT文档知识库","body":"按分组浏览各文档文件夹（每个文件夹一个入口页）：","route":"/","pageTitle":"GT文档知识库","headingTitle":"GT文档知识库"},"/?id=默认":{"slug":"/?id=默认","title":"默认","body":"- <a href=\"html/index_使用说明.html\">使用说明</a> · `md/使用说明`（来源：本地文件夹）","route":"/","pageTitle":"GT文档知识库","headingTitle":"默认"},"/?id=其他":{"slug":"/?id=其他","title":"其他","body":"- [全部文档（合并视图）](html/index_all.html)","route":"/","pageTitle":"GT文档知识库","headingTitle":"其他"}},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md":{"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=rlm-reduced-lane-mode-测试用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=rlm-reduced-lane-mode-测试用例","title":"RLM (Reduced Lane Mode) 测试用例","body":"> 芯片测试 CLI — 覆盖全部 `rlm set / rlm show` 命令与 RLM 寄存器直接读写对照，三种速率 800GR8 / 400GR4 / 200GR2 各测一轮。\n> 所有命令均在 `CMD_VIEW_SYSTEM`（DEBUG）视图下执行，自动携带 `[ chip N ]` 前缀。\n> 相关源文件：`sdk/src/cli/modules/soc/qlake/cli_rlm.c`、`sdk/src/soc/qlake/ql/ql_npu_rlm.c`、`sdk/include/soc/qlake/ql/ql_npu_rlm.h`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"RLM (Reduced Lane Mode) 测试用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=目录":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=目录","title":"目录","body":"1. [测试环境与准备](#1-测试环境与准备)\n2. [寻址、速率与寄存器速查](#2-寻址速率与寄存器速查)\n3. [寄存器直读 / 直写用例](#3-寄存器直读--直写用例)\n4. [set 命令用例](#4-set-命令用例)\n5. [show 命令用例](#5-show-命令用例)\n6. [三种速率 lane 缩减与恢复](#6-三种速率-lane-缩减与恢复)\n7. [中断用例](#7-中断用例)\n8. [复位用例](#8-复位用例)\n9. [错误与边界用例](#9-错误与边界用例)\n10. [LLR + RLM 联合用例](#10-llr--rlm-联合用例)\n11. [附录 A — 命令速查表](#附录-a--命令速查表)\n12. [附录 B — 寄存器/字段速查表](#附录-b--寄存器字段速查表)\n13. [附录 C — 判定准则与恢复清单](#附录-c--判定准则与恢复清单)\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"目录"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_1-测试环境与准备":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_1-测试环境与准备","title":"1. 测试环境与准备","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"1. 测试环境与准备"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_11-环境":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_11-环境","title":"1.1 环境","body":"| 项目 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 测试视图 | `CMD_VIEW_SYSTEM`（DEBUG） |\n| Chip 索引 | `chip 0` |\n| 前置条件 | 端口已按目标速率配置完成，PCS 链路已锁定（link up）；如验证 LLR 相关用例需先 enable LLR |\n| 寄存器访问 | RLM 寄存器为**直接寄存器**，用 `reg read / reg write`；无需 `memory read` |\n| 计数器特性 | `RLM_SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18c)`、`RLM_RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18d)`、`RLM_AM_CRC_ERROR_STAT(0x18e)`、`RLM_EXCEED_DSK_CAPABILITY(0x17b)` 为 **RC（Read-Clear）**，读取后自动清零，禁止为取 raw 值而重复读取 |\n| 速率自动识别 | `rlm set ... enable/disable` 不再需要速率参数：CLI 内部用 `ql_macw_speed_get()` 读取端口当前速率，再判断是否支持 RLM |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"1.1 环境"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_12-前置检查":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_12-前置检查","title":"1.2 前置检查","body":"port show chip 0 chiplet 0 port 0 stat        # 确认端口速率/链路\nrlm show port-id 0 config                     # 确认可读到 RLM 寄存器\n\n> `rlm show ...` 输出第一段会打印 `inst=0x....  module=<id>`，该 `module` 即后续 `reg read/write` 要用的 module-id；每条寄存器的 `reg=<id>` 即 reg-id，可直接复制到 `reg read/write`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"1.2 前置检查"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_2-寻址、速率与寄存器速查":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_2-寻址、速率与寄存器速查","title":"2. 寻址、速率与寄存器速查","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2. 寻址、速率与寄存器速查"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_21-两种寻址形式":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_21-两种寻址形式","title":"2.1 两种寻址形式","body":"所有命令都有两种等价形式：\n\nrlm set  port-id <0-511>            <sub-cmd> ...      # port-id 形式\nrlm set  pipe <0-63> channel <0-7>  <sub-cmd> ...      # pipe+channel 形式\nrlm show port-id <0-511>            <sub-cmd>\nrlm show pipe <0-63> channel <0-7>  <sub-cmd>\n\n换算关系：\n\npipe    = port_id / 8\nchannel = port_id % 8\nport_id = pipe * 8 + channel\n\n> 底层 RLM 硬件 API 按 **pipe（MAC）粒度** 操作；`channel` 只用于换算端口、打印与 `enable/disable` 的旁路位。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.1 两种寻址形式"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_22-速率与端口映射":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_22-速率与端口映射","title":"2.2 速率与端口映射","body":"| 速率 | Lane 数 | 有效起始 Channel | RLM 使能 | 端口旁路位（BYPASS_RLM_EN） |\n|------|--------|-----------------|---------|----------------------------|\n| 800GR8 | 8 | 0 | 支持 | bit0（ch0~7 整 MAC 一个端口） |\n| 400GR4 | 4 | 0, 4 | 支持 | bit0 / bit2 |\n| 200GR2 | 2 | 0, 2, 4, 6 | 支持 | bit0 / bit1 / bit2 / bit3 |\n| 400GR8 | 8 | 0 | 不支持（CLI 报错） | — |\n| 200GR4 / 100GR4 / 100GR2 / 100GR1 / 50GR* / 25GR1 / 10GR1 / HEI* | — | — | 不支持（CLI 报错） | — |\n\n| 速率 | Port 0 | Port 1 | Port 2 | Port 3 |\n|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| 800GR8 | Lane 0-7 | — | — | — |\n| 400GR4 | Lane 0-3 | Lane 4-7 | — | — |\n| 200GR2 | Lane 0-1 | Lane 2-3 | Lane 4-5 | Lane 6-7 |\n\n> `enable/disable` 对一个 MAC（pipe）生效；EN 为整 MAC 全局位，单端口是否生效由 `BYPASS_RLM_EN` 对应位决定。仅当该 MAC 上所有端口都被旁路时，全局 `EN` 才清 0。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.2 速率与端口映射"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_23-pcs-子块-模块-实例映射":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_23-pcs-子块-模块-实例映射","title":"2.3 PCS 子块 / 模块 / 实例映射","body":"RLM 寄存器在三个 PCS 子块中布局完全一致，仅寄存器 ID 不同；按 `pipe % 16` 选择：\n\n| pipe % 16 | 子块 | module-id（示例，以 `reg show module-id-list` 为准） | block | instance-id |\n|-----------|------|------------------------------|-------|-------------|\n| 0-7 | `MACW_PCS_MACW_PCS` | 104 | p | `(pipe/16)<<16 \\| p` |\n| 8 / 15 | `SDS_CMU_PCS_MACW_PCS` | 132 | 0 / 1 | `(pipe/16)<<16 \\| (0 或 1)` |\n| 9-14 | `SDS_PCS_MACW_PCS` | 137 | p-9 | `(pipe/16)<<16 \\| (p-9)` |\n\n> `instance-id` = `(chiplet << 16) | block`，chiplet = `pipe / 16`。例如 chip0 / pipe0 → `0x00000000`；pipe3 → `0x00000003`；pipe11 → `0x00000002`（SDS_PCS，module 137）。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.3 PCS 子块 / 模块 / 实例映射"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_24-rlm-fsm-状态值":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_24-rlm-fsm-状态值","title":"2.4 RLM FSM 状态值","body":"| TX FSM | 值 | 含义 |\n|--------|----|------|\n| INIT | 0 | 待机，全宽度模式 |\n| SWITCH | 1 | 通道切换协调中 |\n| REDUCE | 2 | 稳定运行于精简宽度 |\n\n| RX FSM | 值 | 含义 |\n|--------|----|------|\n| INIT | 0 | 未锁定 AM |\n| LOCK | 1 | 正常工作态，AM 已锁定 |\n| SWITCH | 2 | 通道切换中 |\n| REDUCE | 3 | 精简宽度，已稳定 |\n\n> `RLM_SWITCH_FSM_STATUS(0x17c)`：TX FSM 每 lane 一个（8 个独立），位于 bits[15:0]（每 lane 2bit）；RX FSM 每 port 一个（4 个共享），寄存器按 lane 展示于 bits[31:16]，同 port 的 lane 读数相同。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.4 RLM FSM 状态值"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_25-中断位布局":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_25-中断位布局","title":"2.5 中断位布局","body":"`INTR_STS_0(0x030)` / `INTR_STS_MASK_0(0x034)` / `INTR_ENABLE_0(0x038)`：\n\n| Bit | 中断源 |\n|:---:|--------|\n| 7:0 | LINK（PCS 链路状态） |\n| 15:8 | RX_LINK_DOWN |\n| 19:16 | RLM_TX_LINK_DOWN（每 port 1bit） |\n| 23:20 | RLM_RX_LINK_DOWN（每 port 1bit） |\n| 27:24 | RLM_RX_REDUCE_INTR（每 port 1bit） |\n| 28 | SE_HIT |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.5 中断位布局"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_26-复位类型":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_26-复位类型","title":"2.6 复位类型","body":"| 复位类型 | 作用范围 | FSM 影响 |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `pcs-tx` | RLM 内部 PCS 侧 TX 模块（每 lane 独立） | FSM 复位 → INIT |\n| `pcs-rx` | RLM 内部 PCS 侧 RX 模块（每 lane 独立） | FSM 复位 → INIT |\n| `sds-tx` | RLM 内部 Serdes 侧 TX 数据流 | FSM 状态不变，数据流停止 |\n| `sds-rx` | RLM 内部 Serdes 侧 RX 数据流 | FSM 状态不变，数据流停止 |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.6 复位类型"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_27-计数器说明":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_27-计数器说明","title":"2.7 计数器说明","body":"每条 lane 的切换/故障码统计为 **4bit 饱和计数器**（最大 15）；AM CRC 错误为 **8bit 饱和计数器**（最大 255）。\n\n| 计数器（CLI 列名） | 寄存器 / 字段 |\n|-------------------|--------------|\n| TX Switch Cnt | `RLM_SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18c)[31:0]`（8 lane × 4bit） |\n| RX Switch Cnt | `RLM_SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18c)[63:32]` |\n| TX Fault Cnt | `RLM_RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18d)[31:0]` |\n| RX Fault Cnt | `RLM_RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT(0x18d)[63:32]` |\n| AM CRC Err | `RLM_AM_CRC_ERROR_STAT(0x18e)`（8 lane × 8bit） |\n| Exceed DSK | `RLM_EXCEED_DSK_CAPABILITY(0x17b)[7:0]` |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"2.7 计数器说明"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_3-寄存器直读-直写用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_3-寄存器直读-直写用例","title":"3. 寄存器直读 / 直写用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"3. 寄存器直读 / 直写用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_30-命令语法":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_30-命令语法","title":"3.0 命令语法","body":"reg read  module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> [ count <N> ]\nreg read  module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> field <offset> <len>\nreg write module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> value <HEX<0-FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF>>\nreg write module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> field <offset> <len> value <HEX>\nreg show reg-id-list   module-id <M>\nreg show field-id-list reg-id <R>\n\n- `module-id`：PCS 子块号（`rlm show config` 打印的 `module=<id>`；MACW_PCS 通常为 104）。\n- `instance-id`：`(chiplet << 16) | block`（见 2.3）。\n- `reg-id`：RLM 寄存器号（`rlm show config` 每条打印的 `reg=<id>`）。\n\n> 下文以 **chip0 / pipe0 / MACW_PCS（module-id=104，instance-id=0x00000000）** 为例；reg-id 数值以本 SDK `ql_reg_def.h` 为准，可用 `rlm show ... config` 打印的 `reg=` 值核对。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"3.0 命令语法"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_31-rlm-寄存器-reg-id-速查":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_31-rlm-寄存器-reg-id-速查","title":"3.1 RLM 寄存器 reg-id 速查","body":"| 地址 | 寄存器名 | MACW_PCS(pipe0-7) | SDS_CMU_PCS(pipe8/15) | SDS_PCS(pipe9-14) |\n|------|---------|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:-----------------:|\n| 0x170 | CFG_RLM | 7561 | 10576 | 10780 |\n| 0x171 | CFG_RLM_FAULT_SDS_LANE | 7562 | 10577 | 10781 |\n| 0x172 | CFG_RLM_LANE_SWAP | 7563 | 10578 | 10782 |\n| 0x173 | CFG_RLM_AM_PERIOD | 7564 | 10579 | 10783 |\n| 0x174 | CFG_RLM_SDS_TX_VLD | 7565 | 10580 | 10784 |\n| 0x175 | CFG_RLM_LANE_LOCK | 7566 | 10581 | 10785 |\n| 0x176 | CFG_RLM_SDS_FAULT_MASK | 7567 | 10582 | 10786 |\n| 0x177 | CFG_RLM_RX_UE_FAULT_TH | 7568 | 10583 | 10787 |\n| 0x178 | CFG_RLM_CRC_CHECK | 7569 | 10584 | 10788 |\n| 0x179 | CFG_RLM_RST | 7570 | 10585 | 10789 |\n| 0x17a | RLM_RX_LINK_STATUS | 7571 | 10586 | 10790 |\n| 0x17b | RLM_EXCEED_DSK_CAPABILITY | 7572 | 10587 | 10791 |\n| 0x17c | RLM_SWITCH_FSM_STATUS | 7573 | 10588 | 10792 |\n| 0x17d | RLM_FAULT_LANE_STATUS | 7574 | 10589 | 10793 |\n| 0x18c | RLM_SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT | 7578 | 10593 | 10797 |\n| 0x18d | RLM_RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT | 7579 | 10594 | 10798 |\n| 0x18e | RLM_AM_CRC_ERROR_STAT | 7580 | 10595 | 10799 |\n| 0x030 | INTR_STS_0 | 7503 | 10518 | 10722 |\n| 0x034 | INTR_STS_MASK_0 | 7504 | 10519 | 10723 |\n| 0x038 | INTR_ENABLE_0 | 7505 | 10520 | 10724 |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"3.1 RLM 寄存器 reg-id 速查"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_32-寄存器读写用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_32-寄存器读写用例","title":"3.2 寄存器读写用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"3.2 寄存器读写用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-01-直读-cfg_rlm-与-rlm-show-config-交叉验证":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-01-直读-cfg_rlm-与-rlm-show-config-交叉验证","title":"TC-REG-01 — 直读 CFG_RLM 与 `rlm show config` 交叉验证","body":"reg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**步骤**：直读 `CFG_RLM` raw 值；再用 `rlm show config` 读同一寄存器。\n**预期**：两处 raw 一致；`config` 打印的 `reg=` 与 `reg-id` 一致；`EN / TX_AFIFO_TH / BYPASS_RLM_EN` 字段与直读按位解析一致。\n**PASS 判定**：raw 相等，且字段解析一致。\n\n> 注意：`rlm show config` 当前 `LOOP_BACK_EN` 恒打印 `0x00`（源码 TODO 未回读），验证 loopback 请以 `CFG_RLM bits[8:1]` 直读为准。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-01 — 直读 CFG_RLM 与 `rlm show config` 交叉验证"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-02-直写-cfg_rlmen-后直读回读":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-02-直写-cfg_rlmen-后直读回读","title":"TC-REG-02 — 直写 CFG_RLM.EN 后直读回读","body":"# 置 EN=1（保留其它字段，示例 raw=0x0000...0001）\nreg write module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561 value 0x0000000000000001\nreg read  module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561\n# 清 EN=0\nreg write module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561 value 0x0000000000000000\nreg read  module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561\n\n**预期**：回读 raw bit0 与写入一致；`rlm show config` 的 `EN` 随之一致。\n**注意**：直写会覆盖整个 64bit 寄存器，请先读出原值再按位修改，勿直接把 EN 之外的字段清零。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-02 — 直写 CFG_RLM.EN 后直读回读"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-03-字段级直写-tx_afifo_th":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-03-字段级直写-tx_afifo_th","title":"TC-REG-03 — 字段级直写 TX_AFIFO_TH","body":"# 字段方式：bitoff=9 len=4（TX_AFIFO_TH）\nreg write module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561 field 9 4 value 0x5\nreg read  module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561 field 9 4\n\n**预期**：字段回读 = 0x5；`rlm show config` → `TX_AFIFO_TH=5`。\n**恢复**：复位默认值 0xC（12）：`reg write ... field 9 4 value 0xC`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-03 — 字段级直写 TX_AFIFO_TH"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-04-rc-计数器读清零验证":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-04-rc-计数器读清零验证","title":"TC-REG-04 — RC 计数器读清零验证","body":"# 读取前后各一次，第二次应为 0（或仅统计两次读取之间的新事件）\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\n\n**步骤**：连续两次读 counter。\n**预期**：`SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT / RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT / AM_CRC_ERROR_STAT / EXCEED_DSK_CAPABILITY` 均为 RC；第二次读的值反映两次读取之间的新事件，链路静止时应为全 0。\n**PASS 判定**：RC 行为符合\"读后清零\"。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-04 — RC 计数器读清零验证"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-05-直读状态寄存器（fsm-fault-reset）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-05-直读状态寄存器（fsm-fault-reset）","title":"TC-REG-05 — 直读状态寄存器（FSM / Fault / Reset）","body":"reg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7573   # RLM_SWITCH_FSM_STATUS (0x17c)\nreg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7574   # RLM_FAULT_LANE_STATUS (0x17d)\nreg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7570   # CFG_RLM_RST (0x179)\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 fault-lane-status\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\n\n**预期**：直读 raw 与 `rlm show` 输出的 `raw=0x...` 一致。\n- `0x17c`：`TX = raw[15:0]` 每 lane 2bit；`RX = raw[31:16]` 每 lane 2bit。\n- `0x17d`：`TX_Fault = raw[7:0]`；`RX_Fault = raw[15:8]`。\n- `0x179`：PCS_TX/PCS_RX/SDS_TX/SDS_RX 各 16bit（SEL[7:0]+VAL[15:8]）。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-05 — 直读状态寄存器（FSM / Fault / Reset）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-06-跨-pcs-子块（pipe-8-9-11）直读":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-reg-06-跨-pcs-子块（pipe-8-9-11）直读","title":"TC-REG-06 — 跨 PCS 子块（pipe 8 / 9 / 11）直读","body":"对 SDS 区 pipe 直读，验证 `ql_npu_rlm_pcs_reg_loc_get` 的子块重映射正确：\n\n# pipe 8  -> SDS_CMU_PCS, module-id=132, instance-id=0x00000000\nreg read module-id 132 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 10576\n# pipe 9  -> SDS_PCS,     module-id=137, instance-id=0x00000000\nreg read module-id 137 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 10780\n# pipe 11 -> SDS_PCS,     module-id=137, instance-id=0x00000002\nreg read module-id 137 instance-id 0x00000002 reg-id 10780\n\n**预期**：均读回成功；与 `rlm show pipe 8 channel 0 config` / `rlm show pipe 9 channel 0 config` / `rlm show pipe 11 channel 0 config` 打印的 `module=`、`inst=`、`reg=`、`raw=` 一致。\n**PASS 判定**：子块/block/reg-id 三者映射一致，无越界错误。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-REG-06 — 跨 PCS 子块（pipe 8 / 9 / 11）直读"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_4-set-命令用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_4-set-命令用例","title":"4. set 命令用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4. set 命令用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_41-enable-disable":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_41-enable-disable","title":"4.1 enable / disable","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.1 enable / disable"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-01-rlm-使能（800gr8）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-01-rlm-使能（800gr8）","title":"TC-SET-01 — RLM 使能（800GR8）","body":"rlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**步骤**：确认端口已配 800GR8 且 link up；enable；验证配置与状态。\n**预期**：\n- 打印 `RLM enabled: chip=0 pipe=0 channel=0  inst=0x.... module=<id>  speed=800GR8`\n- `CFG_RLM.EN=1 (ENABLE)`，`BYPASS_RLM_EN` 对应位（bit0）清 0\n- `rlm show port-id 0 status` → Port Type: 800GR8，RX Link Status port0=UP\n- enable 后自动适配 `CFG_HETS_DIS_COMP`（打印 `DIS_COMP before/after`）\n\n**PASS 判定**：`EN=1` 且本端口旁路位=0；DIS_COMP 有 before/after 对比输出。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-01 — RLM 使能（800GR8）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-02-rlm-禁能（800gr8）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-02-rlm-禁能（800gr8）","title":"TC-SET-02 — RLM 禁能（800GR8）","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 disable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：打印 `RLM disabled: ... speed=800GR8`；`BYPASS_RLM_EN` 对应位置 1；该 MAC 全部端口都旁路时 `EN=0`。\n**PASS 判定**：本端口不再生效；同 MAC 其它端口状态保持命令前状态。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-02 — RLM 禁能（800GR8）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-03-rlm-使能（400gr4，两个端口独立）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-03-rlm-使能（400gr4，两个端口独立）","title":"TC-SET-03 — RLM 使能（400GR4，两个端口独立）","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 enable          # ch0，旁路位 bit0\nrlm set  port-id 4 enable          # ch4，旁路位 bit2\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm show port-id 4 config\n\n**预期**：`EN=1`；`BYPASS_RLM_EN` bit0=0、bit2=0。仅 enable port4 时 port0 保持原状态。\n**PASS 判定**：两端口旁路位独立正确。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-03 — RLM 使能（400GR4，两个端口独立）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-04-rlm-使能（200gr2，四端口）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-04-rlm-使能（200gr2，四端口）","title":"TC-SET-04 — RLM 使能（200GR2，四端口）","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable           # bit0\nrlm set port-id 2 enable           # bit1\nrlm set port-id 4 enable           # bit2\nrlm set port-id 6 enable           # bit3\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：`EN=1`，`BYPASS_RLM_EN=0x0`（4 位全 0）。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-04 — RLM 使能（200GR2，四端口）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-05-enabledisable-循环":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-05-enabledisable-循环","title":"TC-SET-05 — enable/disable 循环","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set port-id 0 disable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：EN/旁路位按 enable→disable→enable 正确翻转，无残留、无报错。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-05 — enable/disable 循环"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_42-tx-afifo-th":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_42-tx-afifo-th","title":"4.2 tx-afifo-th","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.2 tx-afifo-th"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-06-tx_afifo_th-设置":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-06-tx_afifo_th-设置","title":"TC-SET-06 — TX_AFIFO_TH 设置","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 tx-afifo-th 5\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 tx-afifo-th 12\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM.TX_AFIFO_TH=5`，再恢复 12（复位默认 0xC）。\n**直读交叉**：`reg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561 field 9 4` → 5 / 12。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-06 — TX_AFIFO_TH 设置"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_43-loopback":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_43-loopback","title":"4.3 loopback","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.3 loopback"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-07-per-lane-loopback-使能禁能":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-07-per-lane-loopback-使能禁能","title":"TC-SET-07 — per-lane loopback 使能/禁能","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 loopback lane-mask 0x03 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 loopback lane-mask 0x03 disable\n\n**预期**：打印 `RLM loopback enabled/disabled: ... lane-mask=0x03`。\n**直读验证**（`rlm show config` 的 LOOP_BACK_EN 恒为 0，需直读）：\nreg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 7561\n# bits[8:1] = LOOP_BACK_EN；使能 0x03 时 bit1/bit2 = 1（lane0/lane1）\n\n**PASS 判定**：`CFG_RLM bits[8:1]` 与 lane-mask 对应位一致。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-07 — per-lane loopback 使能/禁能"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_44-bypass":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_44-bypass","title":"4.4 bypass","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.4 bypass"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-08-bypass-单端口（800gr8）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-08-bypass-单端口（800gr8）","title":"TC-SET-08 — bypass 单端口（800GR8）","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 bypass port-mask 0x1 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 bypass port-mask 0x1 disable\n\n**预期**：`BYPASS_RLM_EN` bit0 = 1 / 0；日志 `port-mask=0x1`。\n**注意**：`bypass` 不改变全局 `EN`，只置/清指定 200G 单元旁路位。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-08 — bypass 单端口（800GR8）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-09-bypass-多端口（200gr2）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-09-bypass-多端口（200gr2）","title":"TC-SET-09 — bypass 多端口（200GR2）","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm set port-id 2 enable\nrlm set port-id 0 bypass port-mask 0x5 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：`BYPASS_RLM_EN=0x5`（port0+port2 旁路），port1/port3 不受影响。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-09 — bypass 多端口（200GR2）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_45-fault-sds-lane":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_45-fault-sds-lane","title":"4.5 fault-sds-lane","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.5 fault-sds-lane"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-10-serdes-故障-lane-软件注入":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-10-serdes-故障-lane-软件注入","title":"TC-SET-10 — Serdes 故障 lane 软件注入","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 fault-sds-lane tx-mask 0x03 rx-mask 0x0C\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm show port-id 0 fault-lane-status\nrlm set  port-id 0 fault-sds-lane tx-mask 0x00 rx-mask 0x00\n\n**预期**：\n- `CFG_RLM_FAULT_SDS_LANE`: `TX_SDS_LANE_NUM=0x03`, `RX_SDS_LANE_NUM=0x0C`\n- `fault-lane-status` → lane0/lane1 TX=FAULT；lane2/lane3 RX=FAULT\n**直读交叉**：`reg read ... reg-id 7562` → bits[7:0]=0x03, bits[15:8]=0x0C。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-10 — Serdes 故障 lane 软件注入"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_46-lane-swap":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_46-lane-swap","title":"4.6 lane-swap","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.6 lane-swap"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-11-lane-swap-全等映射-交叉映射":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-11-lane-swap-全等映射-交叉映射","title":"TC-SET-11 — lane-swap 全等映射 / 交叉映射","body":"# 交叉映射（示例）\nrlm set  port-id 0 lane-swap tx 0x00DB6C rx 0x00DB6C\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n# 恢复全等映射 laneN -> SDS N\nrlm set  port-id 0 lane-swap tx 0x00FAC6 rx 0x00FAC6\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_LANE_SWAP` 打印每 lane 的 TX->SDS / RX->SDS 映射与设定一致；`0x00FAC6` 为 laneN→SDS N 全等映射。\n**直读交叉**：`reg read ... reg-id 7563`：TX lane i = raw[3i+2:3i]，RX lane i = raw[24+3i+2:24+3i]，3bit/lane。\n\n**PASS 判定**：直读每 lane 3bit 值与 `show config` 映射表一致；流量正常通过。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-11 — lane-swap 全等映射 / 交叉映射"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_47-am-period":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_47-am-period","title":"4.7 am-period","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.7 am-period"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-12-am-周期设置":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-12-am-周期设置","title":"TC-SET-12 — AM 周期设置","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 am-period 0\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 am-period 5\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 am-period 8\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 am-period 0\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_AM_PERIOD.VAL` = 设定值，且 `AM period=` 随映射表变化：\n\n| VAL | 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 | 7 | 8 |\n|-----|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| Period | 256 | 512 | 1024 | 2560 | 5120 | 10240 | 20480 | 40960 | 81920 |\n\n**直读交叉**：`reg read ... reg-id 7564 field 0 4`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-12 — AM 周期设置"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_48-sds-tx-vld":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_48-sds-tx-vld","title":"4.8 sds-tx-vld","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.8 sds-tx-vld"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-13-serdes-tx-valid-阈值":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-13-serdes-tx-valid-阈值","title":"TC-SET-13 — Serdes TX valid 阈值","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 sds-tx-vld down 10 up 5\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 sds-tx-vld down 0 up 0\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_SDS_TX_VLD`: `DOWN_CNT=10`(bits[4:0])、`UP_CNT=5`(bits[9:5])；恢复 0/0。\n**直读交叉**：`reg read ... reg-id 7565`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-13 — Serdes TX valid 阈值"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_49-lane-lock":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_49-lane-lock","title":"4.9 lane-lock","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.9 lane-lock"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-14-am-锁定失锁阈值":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-14-am-锁定失锁阈值","title":"TC-SET-14 — AM 锁定/失锁阈值","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 lane-lock cmp-num 16 mismatch 4\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 lane-lock cmp-num 0 mismatch 0\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_LANE_LOCK`: `CMP_NUM_TH=16`(bits[4:0])、`CMP_MISMATCH_TH=4`(bits[9:5])；恢复 0/0。\n**语义**：连续 `CMP_NUM_TH` 次正确 AM 判定 LOCK；锁定后连续 `CMP_MISMATCH_TH` 次失配判定 UNLOCK。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-14 — AM 锁定/失锁阈值"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_410-sds-fault-mask":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_410-sds-fault-mask","title":"4.10 sds-fault-mask","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.10 sds-fault-mask"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-15-serdes-故障信号屏蔽":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-15-serdes-故障信号屏蔽","title":"TC-SET-15 — Serdes 故障信号屏蔽","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 sds-fault-mask sigdet 0x0F rxd-vld 0xF0 cpld 0x00 txc-vld 0xFF\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 sds-fault-mask sigdet 0x00 rxd-vld 0x00 cpld 0x00 txc-vld 0x00\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_SDS_FAULT_MASK`: `SIGDET=0x0F`[7:0]、`RXD_VLD=0xF0`[15:8]、`CPLD=0x00`[23:16]、`TXC_VLD=0xFF`[31:24]。\n**语义**：每 bit 对应一条 lane，1=屏蔽该类故障。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-15 — Serdes 故障信号屏蔽"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_411-rx-ue-fault-th":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_411-rx-ue-fault-th","title":"4.11 rx-ue-fault-th","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.11 rx-ue-fault-th"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-16-连续-rx-ue-错误阈值":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-16-连续-rx-ue-错误阈值","title":"TC-SET-16 — 连续 RX UE 错误阈值","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 rx-ue-fault-th 5\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 rx-ue-fault-th 0\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_RX_UE_FAULT_TH.NUM=5`(bits[4:0])；恢复 0。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-16 — 连续 RX UE 错误阈值"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_412-crc-check":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_412-crc-check","title":"4.12 crc-check","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.12 crc-check"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-17-am-crc-校验与阈值":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-17-am-crc-校验与阈值","title":"TC-SET-17 — AM CRC 校验与阈值","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 crc-check enable err-th 10\nrlm show port-id 0 config\nrlm set  port-id 0 crc-check disable err-th 0\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_CRC_CHECK`: `EN=1`(bit0)、`ERR_TH=10`(bits[5:1])；关闭后 `EN=0`。\n**直读交叉**：`reg read ... reg-id 7569`。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-17 — AM CRC 校验与阈值"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_413-test-force-fault":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_413-test-force-fault","title":"4.13 test force-fault","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"4.13 test force-fault"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-18-强制-lane-故障注入（rxtx）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-set-18-强制-lane-故障注入（rxtx）","title":"TC-SET-18 — 强制 lane 故障注入（RX/TX）","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fault-lane-status\nrlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\n\n**预期**：采用 read-modify-write，只影响指定方向的 lanes；注入后 `fault-lane-status` 对应 lane 为 FAULT，deassert 后恢复 ok。\n**语义**：与 `fault-sds-lane` 操作同一寄存器 `CFG_RLM_FAULT_SDS_LANE(0x171)`，`force-fault` 便于按方向增量修改。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SET-18 — 强制 lane 故障注入（RX/TX）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_5-show-命令用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_5-show-命令用例","title":"5. show 命令用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"5. show 命令用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-01-config":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-01-config","title":"TC-SHOW-01 — config","body":"rlm show port-id 0 config\n\n**预期**：打印 `module=/inst=`、各寄存器 `reg=/addr=/raw=`，字段包括：\n`CFG_RLM(EN/TX_AFIFO_TH/BYPASS_RLM_EN)`、`CFG_RLM_CRC_CHECK`、`CFG_RLM_LANE_SWAP(逐 lane 映射)`、`CFG_RLM_FAULT_SDS_LANE`、`CFG_RLM_AM_PERIOD`、`CFG_RLM_SDS_TX_VLD`、`CFG_RLM_LANE_LOCK`、`CFG_RLM_SDS_FAULT_MASK`、`CFG_RLM_RX_UE_FAULT_TH`、`CFG_RLM_RST`、`CFG_HETS_DIS_COMP_<ch>`、`am_decrease_scale`。\n**PASS 判定**：所有期望字段均可读且与直读 raw 一致。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-01 — config"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-02-status":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-02-status","title":"TC-SHOW-02 — status","body":"rlm show port-id 0 status\n\n**预期**：`Port Type`、`FEC Mode`、`RLM_RX_LINK_STATUS`、`RLM_FAULT_LANE_STATUS` raw；逐 port 的 RX Link UP/DOWN（4 port）；TX/RX Fault Lanes 位图。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-02 — status"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-03-fsm":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-03-fsm","title":"TC-SHOW-03 — fsm","body":"rlm show port-id 0 fsm\n\n**预期**：`RLM_SWITCH_FSM_STATUS` raw；8 条 lane 的 TX FSM（8 独立）；8 条 lane 的 RX FSM（同 port 共享，port = lane/2）。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-03 — fsm"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-04-counter":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-04-counter","title":"TC-SHOW-04 — counter","body":"rlm show port-id 0 counter\n\n**预期**：打印 RC 寄存器 raw 标注；`TX/RX Switch Cnt`、`TX/RX Fault Cnt`、`AM CRC Err` 各 8 lane 值；`Exceed DSK` 位图。末尾提示 `RC counters cleared on read`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-04 — counter"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-05-rx-link-status":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-05-rx-link-status","title":"TC-SHOW-05 — rx-link-status","body":"rlm show port-id 0 rx-link-status\n\n**预期**：`RLM_RX_LINK_STATUS(0x17a)` raw + 4 个 port 的 UP/DOWN 与 bit 号。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-05 — rx-link-status"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-06-fault-lane-status":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-06-fault-lane-status","title":"TC-SHOW-06 — fault-lane-status","body":"rlm show port-id 0 fault-lane-status\n\n**预期**：`RLM_FAULT_LANE_STATUS(0x17d)` raw；逐 lane 的 TX_Fault / RX_Fault；末尾 `TX_Fault=0x.. RX_Fault=0x..`。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-06 — fault-lane-status"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-07-reset-status":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-07-reset-status","title":"TC-SHOW-07 — reset-status","body":"rlm show port-id 0 reset-status\n\n**预期**：`CFG_RLM_RST(0x179)` raw；PCS_TX/PCS_RX/SDS_TX/SDS_RX 的 SEL/VAL 与告警 `ALL(asserted)/released/hw-auto`；`SEL=0` 为硬件控制，`SEL=1` 为软件接管。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-07 — reset-status"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-08-intr-status":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-08-intr-status","title":"TC-SHOW-08 — intr-status","body":"rlm show port-id 0 intr-status\n\n**预期**：打印 `INTR_ENABLE_0(0x38)`、`INTR_STS_MASK_0(0x34)`、`INTR_STS_0(0x30)` 的 raw；按 2.5 的位段逐项列出 → 见 [7. 中断用例](#7-中断用例)。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-08 — intr-status"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-09-pipechannel-形式等价性":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-show-09-pipechannel-形式等价性","title":"TC-SHOW-09 — pipe+channel 形式等价性","body":"# 以下三组等价\nrlm show port-id 0 config  ==  rlm show pipe 0 channel 0 config\nrlm show port-id 5 config  ==  rlm show pipe 0 channel 5 config\nrlm show port-id 9 config  ==  rlm show pipe 1 channel 1 config\n\n**预期**：同一 (pipe,channel) 的两种形式输出一致（`channel` 仅影响打印与端口换算）。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-SHOW-09 — pipe+channel 形式等价性"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_6-三种速率-lane-缩减与恢复":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_6-三种速率-lane-缩减与恢复","title":"6. 三种速率 lane 缩减与恢复","body":"> 前置：对应速率使能完成（`rlm set ... enable`）；通过 `test force-fault` 注入 RX/TX lane 故障触发 RLM 缩减；恢复后再次读 FSM/计数器确认。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"6. 三种速率 lane 缩减与恢复"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_61-800gr8":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_61-800gr8","title":"6.1 800GR8","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"6.1 800GR8"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-01-单-lane-故障缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-01-单-lane-故障缩减","title":"TC-LANE-01 — 单 lane 故障缩减","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm                       # 初始 TX=INIT, RX=LOCK\nrlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 status\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\nrlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\n\n**预期**：RX 检测 lane0 故障 → RX FSM `LOCK(1)→SWITCH(2)→REDUCE(3)`；TX FSM `INIT(0)→SWITCH(1)→REDUCE(2)`；`counter` 的 TX/RX Switch Cnt 出现非 0；恢复后返回全宽（RX=LOCK，TX=INIT）。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-01 — 单 lane 故障缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-02-多-lane-逐步缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-02-多-lane-逐步缩减","title":"TC-LANE-02 — 多 lane 逐步缩减","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x03 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x0F assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x0F deassert\n\n**预期**：2 lane 故障 → 可能缩到 400GR4；4 lane 故障 → 可能缩到 200GR2 或更低；每次切换经过 SWITCH，计数器逐次递增。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-02 — 多 lane 逐步缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-03-不同包长下缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-03-不同包长下缩减","title":"TC-LANE-03 — 不同包长下缩减","body":"以 64B / 512B / 1518B / 9000B 各发流一轮，配合 `test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert` → 观察 FSM 进入 REDUCE、`counter` 的 Switch/Fault 计数、切换窗口内丢包情况。\n**预期**：各包长均能完成缩减与恢复；长短包差异仅体现在切换窗口时长与丢包，功能一致。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-03 — 不同包长下缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_62-400gr4":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_62-400gr4","title":"6.2 400GR4","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"6.2 400GR4"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-04-双端口独立缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-04-双端口独立缩减","title":"TC-LANE-04 — 双端口独立缩减","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable          # lane0-3\nrlm set port-id 4 enable          # lane4-7\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x0F assert   # 仅 port0\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 4 fsm\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x0F deassert\n\n**预期**：port0 进入 REDUCE，port4 保持 LOCK（lane4-7 正常）；两端口状态独立、互不影响。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-04 — 双端口独立缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_63-200gr2":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_63-200gr2","title":"6.3 200GR2","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"6.3 200GR2"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-05-单端口缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-05-单端口缩减","title":"TC-LANE-05 — 单端口缩减","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\n\n**预期**：2 lane 中 1 lane 故障 → 缩到更低宽度或触发 port down；恢复后回到正常。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-05 — 单端口缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-06-四端口全部缩减":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-06-四端口全部缩减","title":"TC-LANE-06 — 四端口全部缩减","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm set port-id 2 enable\nrlm set port-id 4 enable\nrlm set port-id 6 enable\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0xFF assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 status\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\n\n**预期**：4 个 port 各自进入缩减状态，独立统计；恢复后全部回全宽。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-06 — 四端口全部缩减"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_64-震荡与稳定性":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_64-震荡与稳定性","title":"6.4 震荡与稳定性","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"6.4 震荡与稳定性"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-07-快速反复缩减恢复":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-lane-07-快速反复缩减恢复","title":"TC-LANE-07 — 快速反复缩减/恢复","body":"rlm set port-id 0 enable\nfor i in 1 2 3 4 5; do\n  rlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x03 assert\n  sleep 0.1\n  rlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x03 deassert\n  sleep 0.1\ndone\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\n\n**预期**：FSM 在 LOCK↔SWITCH↔REDUCE 之间反复切换，不死锁、不丢状态；Switch Cnt 随切换次数递增；`counter` 读后清零，无累积异常。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-LANE-07 — 快速反复缩减/恢复"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_7-中断用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_7-中断用例","title":"7. 中断用例","body":"> `rlm set ... intr enable/mask` 为**整寄存器直接写入**（非按位读改写），需给出完整 29bit 位图（`HEX<0-1FFFFFFF>`）。位布局见 2.5。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"7. 中断用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-01-使能指定中断":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-01-使能指定中断","title":"TC-INTR-01 — 使能指定中断","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 intr enable 0x100000     # bit20 = RLM_RX_LINK_DOWN port0\nrlm show port-id 0 intr-status\n\n**预期**：`INTR_ENABLE_0=0x100000`；`intr-status` 中 `RLM_RX_LINK_DOWN (23:20)` 行 Enable 对应 port0=1。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-INTR-01 — 使能指定中断"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-02-屏蔽中断":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-02-屏蔽中断","title":"TC-INTR-02 — 屏蔽中断","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 intr enable 0x100000\nrlm set  port-id 0 intr mask   0x100000\nrlm show port-id 0 intr-status\n\n**预期**：`INTR_STS_MASK_0=0x100000`；即使故障触发 `INTR_STS_0` 置位，上报被屏蔽。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-INTR-02 — 屏蔽中断"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-03-全范围使能屏蔽清零":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-03-全范围使能屏蔽清零","title":"TC-INTR-03 — 全范围使能/屏蔽/清零","body":"rlm set port-id 0 intr enable 0x1FFFFFFF\nrlm show port-id 0 intr-status\nrlm set port-id 0 intr mask   0x1FFFFFFF\nrlm show port-id 0 intr-status\nrlm set port-id 0 intr enable 0x0\nrlm set port-id 0 intr mask   0x0\n\n**预期**：enable/mask 全 1 → 再全 0；状态寄存器位与设置一致。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-INTR-03 — 全范围使能/屏蔽/清零"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-04-故障触发中断状态":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-intr-04-故障触发中断状态","title":"TC-INTR-04 — 故障触发中断状态","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm set  port-id 0 intr enable 0x1F00000\nrlm set  port-id 0 intr mask   0x0\nrlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0xFF assert\nrlm show port-id 0 intr-status\nrlm show port-id 0 fault-lane-status\nrlm set  port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\nrlm set  port-id 0 intr enable 0x0\n\n**预期**：全部 lane 故障 → `INTR_STS_0` 对应 `RLM_RX_LINK_DOWN` / `RLM_RX_REDUCE_INTR` 位被硬件置位；`fault-lane-status` 全 FAULT。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-INTR-04 — 故障触发中断状态"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_8-复位用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_8-复位用例","title":"8. 复位用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"8. 复位用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-01-pcs-tx-复位":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-01-pcs-tx-复位","title":"TC-RST-01 — PCS TX 复位","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set  port-id 0 reset pcs-tx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set  port-id 0 reset pcs-tx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\n\n**预期**：assert 后 `CFG_RLM_RST.PCS_TX SEL=0x01 VAL=0x01`；PCS TX 复位使 TX FSM → INIT(0)；deassert 后 `VAL=0x00`。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-RST-01 — PCS TX 复位"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-02-pcs-rx-复位":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-02-pcs-rx-复位","title":"TC-RST-02 — PCS RX 复位","body":"rlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-rx lane-mask 0x02 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\nrlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-rx lane-mask 0x02 deassert\n\n**预期**：`PCS_RX SEL=0x02`，assert `VAL=0x02` / deassert `VAL=0x00`；RX FSM 被复位。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-RST-02 — PCS RX 复位"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-03-sds-tx-复位（fsm-不变）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-03-sds-tx-复位（fsm-不变）","title":"TC-RST-03 — SDS TX 复位（FSM 不变）","body":"rlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set  port-id 0 reset sds-tx lane-mask 0xFF assert\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set  port-id 0 reset sds-tx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\n\n**预期**：`SDS_TX SEL=0xFF VAL=0xFF`；Serdes 数据流停止，**FSM 状态保持不变**。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-RST-03 — SDS TX 复位（FSM 不变）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-04-sds-rx-复位":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-04-sds-rx-复位","title":"TC-RST-04 — SDS RX 复位","body":"rlm set port-id 0 reset sds-rx lane-mask 0xFF assert\nrlm show port-id 0 reset-status\nrlm set port-id 0 reset sds-rx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\n\n**预期**：`SDS_RX SEL=0xFF`；行为同 SDS TX（数据流停止、FSM 不变）。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-RST-04 — SDS RX 复位"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-05-pcs-与-sds-复位差异对比":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-rst-05-pcs-与-sds-复位差异对比","title":"TC-RST-05 — PCS 与 SDS 复位差异对比","body":"rlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-tx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-tx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\nrlm set port-id 0 reset sds-tx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm set port-id 0 reset sds-tx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\n\n**预期**：对同一 lane：PCS TX 复位 → TX FSM 归 INIT；SDS TX 复位 → TX FSM 不变。验证\"PCS 复位影响 FSM、SDS 复位不影响 FSM\"。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-RST-05 — PCS 与 SDS 复位差异对比"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_9-错误与边界用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_9-错误与边界用例","title":"9. 错误与边界用例","body":"| 用例 | 命令 | 预期 |\n|------|------|------|\n| TC-ERR-01 不支持速率 | 端口为 100GR1 时 `rlm set port-id 0 enable` | CLI 读取速率后报错：`Error: current speed 100GR1 is not supported by RLM enable.` + `Supported RLM enable speeds: 800GR8, 400GR4, 200GR2`；**不访问寄存器**，`CFG_RLM` 不变 |\n| TC-ERR-02 非法起始 channel | `rlm set pipe 0 channel 1 enable` | 起始 channel 必须为偶通道且与速率占用位匹配；硬件层 `rlm_bypass_bit_get` 校验不通过返回 `GT_E_PARAM`（若该 channel 先被识别为不支持速率，则 CLI 先报\"not supported\"） |\n| TC-ERR-03 am-period 越界 | `rlm set port-id 0 am-period 9` | `Failed to set AM_PERIOD (must be 0-8)`；寄存器不变 |\n| TC-ERR-04 reset 类型越界 | 通过 pipe 形式传入非法 type | `Error: reset type must be 0-3 (pcs-tx/pcs-rx/sds-tx/sds-rx)` |\n| TC-ERR-05 lane-mask=0 | `rlm set port-id 0 loopback lane-mask 0x0 enable` | 掩码为 0 时底层 API 视为 no-op 直接返回成功，寄存器不变 |\n| TC-ERR-06 port-mask=0 | `rlm set port-id 0 bypass port-mask 0x0 enable` | 同 TC-ERR-05，no-op 成功 |\n| TC-ERR-07 直写保留位 | `reg write ... reg-id 7561 value 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF` | 读回确认哪些位可写；未定义位应保持不变/回读为 0，并记录；测试后按原始 raw 恢复 |\n| TC-ERR-08 读越界 reg-id | `reg read module-id 104 instance-id 0x00000000 reg-id 65535` | 读失败返回错误；不得导致挂死 |\n| TC-ERR-09 多 pipe 越界 | `rlm show port-id 511 config`（若无该 pipe） | 端口速率读取失败 → `Error: get port speed type failed ...` |\n| TC-ERR-10 CRC 阈值边界 | `rlm set port-id 0 crc-check enable err-th 31` / `err-th 0` | `ERR_TH=31`（5bit 上限）/ `0`；越界由 CLI 参数范围拦截 |\n\n**PASS 判定**：错误路径给出明确提示且不产生寄存器副作用；边界值写读一致。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"9. 错误与边界用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_10-llr-rlm-联合用例":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=_10-llr-rlm-联合用例","title":"10. LLR + RLM 联合用例","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"10. LLR + RLM 联合用例"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-01-llr-rlm-基础导通":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-01-llr-rlm-基础导通","title":"TC-COMB-01 — LLR + RLM 基础导通","body":"llr set  port-id 0 cfg enable\nrlm set  port-id 0 enable\nrlm show port-id 0 status\nllr show port-id 0 status\n**预期**：两者均使能成功；发流无丢包；RLM status RX Link UP。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-COMB-01 — LLR + RLM 基础导通"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-02-仅-rlm（无-llr）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-02-仅-rlm（无-llr）","title":"TC-COMB-02 — 仅 RLM（无 LLR）","body":"llr set port-id 0 cfg disable\nrlm set port-id 0 enable\n**预期**：RLM 独立工作，不依赖 LLR；流量正常。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-COMB-02 — 仅 RLM（无 LLR）"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-03-rlm-缩减过程中-llr-状态":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-03-rlm-缩减过程中-llr-状态","title":"TC-COMB-03 — RLM 缩减过程中 LLR 状态","body":"llr set port-id 0 cfg enable\nrlm set port-id 0 enable\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nllr show port-id 0 status\nrlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\n**预期**：缩减后 LLR 保持 enable；剩余 lane 流量正常，无死锁。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-COMB-03 — RLM 缩减过程中 LLR 状态"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-04-反复震荡稳定性":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-04-反复震荡稳定性","title":"TC-COMB-04 — 反复震荡稳定性","body":"llr set port-id 0 cfg enable\nrlm set port-id 0 enable\nfor i in 1 2 ... 100; do\n  rlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 assert\n  sleep 0.05\n  rlm set port-id 0 test force-fault rx lane-mask 0x01 deassert\n  sleep 0.05\ndone\nrlm show port-id 0 fsm\nrlm show port-id 0 counter\nllr show port-id 0 status\nrlm show port-id 0 config\n**预期**：100 次震荡后 RLM/LLR 均正常；FSM 最终 LOCK/INIT；配置寄存器未被破坏；无死锁。","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-COMB-04 — 反复震荡稳定性"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-05-带宽对比":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=tc-comb-05-带宽对比","title":"TC-COMB-05 — 带宽对比","body":"分别测 LLR-only / RLM-only / LLR+RLM 三场景吞吐量；对 800GR8 全宽与缩减（4 lane 故障）分别测量。\n**预期**：\n| 场景 | 预期带宽 |\n|------|---------|\n| 800GR8 全宽 | ~800Gbps |\n| 缩减到 4 lane | ~400Gbps |\n| 200GR2 全宽 | ~200Gbps |\n| 200GR2 减到 1 lane | ~100Gbps |\n\n带宽按剩余 lane 数线性下降；RLM 自身不额外占用带宽。\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"TC-COMB-05 — 带宽对比"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-a-命令速查表":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-a-命令速查表","title":"附录 A — 命令速查表","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"附录 A — 命令速查表"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=set-命令":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=set-命令","title":"SET 命令","body":"# 使能/禁能（速率自动识别，无需速率参数）\nrlm set port-id <0-511> enable\nrlm set port-id <0-511> disable\n\n# 环回 / 旁路\nrlm set port-id <0-511> loopback   lane-mask HEX<0-FF> {enable|disable}\nrlm set port-id <0-511> bypass     port-mask HEX<0-F>  {enable|disable}\n\n# 复位\nrlm set port-id <0-511> reset {pcs-tx|pcs-rx|sds-tx|sds-rx} lane-mask HEX<0-FF> {assert|deassert}\n\n# 中断（整寄存器写入）\nrlm set port-id <0-511> intr enable HEX<0-1FFFFFFF>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> intr mask   HEX<0-1FFFFFFF>\n\n# 配置寄存器\nrlm set port-id <0-511> tx-afifo-th      INTEGER<0-15>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> fault-sds-lane   tx-mask HEX<0-FF> rx-mask HEX<0-FF>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> lane-swap        tx HEX<0-FFFFFF> rx HEX<0-FFFFFF>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> am-period        INTEGER<0-8>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> sds-tx-vld       down INTEGER<0-31> up INTEGER<0-31>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> lane-lock        cmp-num INTEGER<0-31> mismatch INTEGER<0-31>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> sds-fault-mask   sigdet HEX<0-FF> rxd-vld HEX<0-FF> cpld HEX<0-FF> txc-vld HEX<0-FF>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> rx-ue-fault-th   INTEGER<0-31>\nrlm set port-id <0-511> crc-check {disable|enable} err-th INTEGER<0-31>\n\n# 故障注入\nrlm set port-id <0-511> test force-fault {rx|tx} lane-mask HEX<0-FF> {assert|deassert}\n\n# 以上所有 SET 均有等价形式:\nrlm set pipe <0-63> channel <0-7> <sub-cmd> ...","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"SET 命令"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=show-命令":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=show-命令","title":"SHOW 命令","body":"rlm show port-id <0-511> status\nrlm show port-id <0-511> fsm\nrlm show port-id <0-511> counter\nrlm show port-id <0-511> config\nrlm show port-id <0-511> rx-link-status\nrlm show port-id <0-511> fault-lane-status\nrlm show port-id <0-511> reset-status\nrlm show port-id <0-511> intr-status\n\n# 等价形式:\nrlm show pipe <0-63> channel <0-7> <sub-cmd>","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"SHOW 命令"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=寄存器访问":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=寄存器访问","title":"寄存器访问","body":"reg read  module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> [ count <N> ]\nreg read  module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> field <offset> <len>\nreg write module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> value <HEX>\nreg write module-id <M> instance-id <I> reg-id <R> field <offset> <len> value <HEX>\nreg show  reg-id-list   module-id <M>\nreg show  field-id-list reg-id <R>\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"寄存器访问"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-b-寄存器字段速查表":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-b-寄存器字段速查表","title":"附录 B — 寄存器/字段速查表","body":"| 地址 | 寄存器名 | 访问 | 字段（bitoff,len） |\n|------|---------|------|-------------------|\n| 0x030 | INTR_STS_0 | RWONE | 见 2.5 |\n| 0x034 | INTR_STS_MASK_0 | RW | 见 2.5 |\n| 0x038 | INTR_ENABLE_0 | RW | 见 2.5 |\n| 0x170 | CFG_RLM | RW | EN(0,1)、LOOP_BACK_EN(1,8)、TX_AFIFO_TH(9,4,复位0xC)、BYPASS_RLM_EN(13,4) |\n| 0x171 | CFG_RLM_FAULT_SDS_LANE | RW | TX_SDS_LANE_NUM(0,8)、RX_SDS_LANE_NUM(8,8) |\n| 0x172 | CFG_RLM_LANE_SWAP | RW | TX_LANE0-7(0..23, 3bit/lane)、RX_LANE0-7(24..47, 3bit/lane) |\n| 0x173 | CFG_RLM_AM_PERIOD | RW | VAL(0,4) |\n| 0x174 | CFG_RLM_SDS_TX_VLD | RW | DOWN_CNT(0,5)、UP_CNT(5,5) |\n| 0x175 | CFG_RLM_LANE_LOCK | RW | CMP_NUM_TH(0,5)、CMP_MISMATCH_TH(5,5) |\n| 0x176 | CFG_RLM_SDS_FAULT_MASK | RW | SIGDET(0,8)、SDS_RXD_VLD(8,8)、CPLD_FAULT(16,8)、SDS_TXC_VLD(24,8) |\n| 0x177 | CFG_RLM_RX_UE_FAULT_TH | RW | NUM(0,5) |\n| 0x178 | CFG_RLM_CRC_CHECK | RW | EN(0,1)、ERR_TH(1,5) |\n| 0x179 | CFG_RLM_RST | RW | PCS_TX_SEL(0,8)、PCS_TX_VAL(8,8)、PCS_RX_SEL(16,8)、PCS_RX_VAL(24,8)、SDS_TX_SEL(32,8)、SDS_TX_VAL(40,8)、SDS_RX_SEL(48,8)、SDS_RX_VAL(56,8) |\n| 0x17a | RLM_RX_LINK_STATUS | R | I(0,4)（每 port 1bit） |\n| 0x17b | RLM_EXCEED_DSK_CAPABILITY | RC | LANE(0,8) |\n| 0x17c | RLM_SWITCH_FSM_STATUS | R | TX FSM(0,16, 2bit/lane)、RX FSM(16,16, 2bit/lane) |\n| 0x17d | RLM_FAULT_LANE_STATUS | R | TX_LANE(0,8)、RX_LANE(8,8) |\n| 0x18c | RLM_SWITCH_CODE_STAT_CNT | RC | TX(0,32, 4bit/lane)、RX(32,32, 4bit/lane) |\n| 0x18d | RLM_RX_FAULT_CODE_STAT_CNT | RC | TX(0,32)、RX(32,32)（4bit/lane） |\n| 0x18e | RLM_AM_CRC_ERROR_STAT | RC | 8bit/lane（0..63） |\n\n---","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"附录 B — 寄存器/字段速查表"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-c-判定准则与恢复清单":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=附录-c-判定准则与恢复清单","title":"附录 C — 判定准则与恢复清单","body":"","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"附录 C — 判定准则与恢复清单"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=c1-判定准则":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=c1-判定准则","title":"C.1 判定准则","body":"| 测试项 | PASS 条件 |\n|--------|----------|\n| 寄存器直读/直写 | 直读 raw 与 `rlm show ... config` 的 raw 一致；字段方式写读回一致 |\n| enable/disable | EN 与 BYPASS_RLM_EN 端口位正确翻转；其它端口状态保持 |\n| 配置寄存器 | `show config` 对应字段 = 设定值，且直读一致 |\n| LANE_SWAP | 逐 lane 3bit 映射与设定一致；流量正常 |\n| AM_PERIOD | VAL 字段正确，Period 映射表一致 |\n| 阈值/掩码类 | 字段值与设定一致，边界值（0/上限）可写读 |\n| CRC_CHECK | EN + ERR_TH 正确；超阈值触发 fault |\n| loopback | `CFG_RLM bits[8:1]` 与 lane-mask 一致（勿用 show config 判定） |\n| bypass | BYPASS_RLM_EN 对应位正确 |\n| 中断 | INTR_ENABLE_0 / INTR_STS_MASK_0 / INTR_STS_0 正确反映 enable/mask/sts |\n| FSM | 故障注入 → LOCK→SWITCH→REDUCE；恢复 → 回到 LOCK/INIT |\n| 计数器 | 4bit 饱和、8bit(CRC) 饱和；RC 读后清零 |\n| 复位 PCS | FSM 归 INIT |\n| 复位 SDS | 数据流停止，FSM 不变 |\n| 缩减/恢复 | 缩减后带宽按 lane 比例下降；恢复后回全宽 |\n| 震荡 | N 次循环后状态正常，无死锁 |","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"C.1 判定准则"},"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=c2-测试后恢复清单（默认建议值）":{"slug":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md?id=c2-测试后恢复清单（默认建议值）","title":"C.2 测试后恢复清单（默认/建议值）","body":"rlm set port-id 0 tx-afifo-th 12\nrlm set port-id 0 am-period 0\nrlm set port-id 0 sds-tx-vld down 0 up 0\nrlm set port-id 0 lane-lock cmp-num 0 mismatch 0\nrlm set port-id 0 sds-fault-mask sigdet 0x00 rxd-vld 0x00 cpld 0x00 txc-vld 0x00\nrlm set port-id 0 rx-ue-fault-th 0\nrlm set port-id 0 crc-check disable err-th 0\nrlm set port-id 0 lane-swap tx 0x00FAC6 rx 0x00FAC6       # 全等映射\nrlm set port-id 0 fault-sds-lane tx-mask 0x00 rx-mask 0x00\nrlm set port-id 0 bypass port-mask 0x0 disable\nrlm set port-id 0 loopback lane-mask 0xFF disable\nrlm set port-id 0 intr enable 0x0\nrlm set port-id 0 intr mask   0x0\nrlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-tx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\nrlm set port-id 0 reset pcs-rx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\nrlm set port-id 0 reset sds-tx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\nrlm set port-id 0 reset sds-rx lane-mask 0xFF deassert\nrlm set port-id 0 disable\n\n> 直写寄存器（第 3 章）后请按读取到的原始 raw 值回写恢复。\n\n---\n\n*相关源文件：`cli_rlm.c` / `ql_npu_rlm.c` / `ql_npu_rlm.h`*\n*寄存器定义：`ql_reg_def.h` / `ql_reg_field.h`*\n*命令语法：`cli_reg.c`（reg read/write）*","route":"/md/RLM_TEST_CASES.md","pageTitle":"RLM_TEST_CASES","headingTitle":"C.2 测试后恢复清单（默认/建议值）"},"site":"html/index_all.html"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md":{"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=快速开始":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=快速开始","title":"快速开始","body":"欢迎使用 md2web。把 Markdown 放进 `docs/md/`，运行构建脚本即可生成完全离线的文档站。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"快速开始"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=阅读区工具栏":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=阅读区工具栏","title":"阅读区工具栏","body":"每篇文档右上角都有一排按钮：\n\n- **复制链接**：复制当前页面的链接地址（含 `#/` 路由，可直接分享给他人）\n- **复制 SVN 链接**：当前文档属于已配置 SVN 仓库时显示，复制仓库地址与文档相对路径\n- **编辑 MD**：打开双栏编辑器——左侧 Markdown 源码按格式分色（标题层级、列表、代码块、公式），右侧实时预览（Mermaid、PacketDiag、KaTeX 公式、代码高亮）；左侧固定大纲导航默认显示，点击章节会同时把源码与预览定位到该处；支持撤销/恢复（`Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Y`）、上传本地图片与附件、文字颜色与表格行列选择器；登录后 `Ctrl+S` 保存**个人草稿**（带版本号，不会直接改动站点），在编辑器里「提交 SVN」后才写回仓库\n- **下载 MD**：下载当前页面对应的 Markdown 源文件\n- **下载本页**：把当前文档导出为自包含 HTML（含图片、图形与目录，可离线转发）\n- **宽屏阅读** / **隐藏序号**：切换阅读布局与标题编号\n\n编辑器常用快捷键：`Ctrl+B` 加粗 · `Ctrl+I` 斜体 · `Ctrl+K` 链接 · `Ctrl+M` 行内公式 · `Ctrl+Shift+M` 公式块 · `Ctrl+Alt+1/2/3` 标题 · `Ctrl+Shift+U`/`Ctrl+Shift+O` 无序/有序列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+K` 任务列表 · `Ctrl+Shift+C` 代码块 · `Ctrl+Shift+G` Mermaid · `Ctrl+Shift+D` PacketDiag · `Ctrl+Shift+T` 表格行列 · `Ctrl+Alt+K` 文字颜色 · `Ctrl+Shift+H` 大纲导航 · `Ctrl+S` 保存草稿 · `Ctrl+Shift+S` 另存为 · `Ctrl+/` 全部快捷键。\n\n> 草稿与提交需要登录认证服务（`python serve.py`）；局域网其他机器访问时同样可以登录编辑，权限由所在仓库的「允许合入 / 允许在线修改」开关决定；`file://` 双击模式为离线只读，编辑器只能下载或保存到本地文件。\n\n左侧栏顶部还有「绘图预览」入口（<a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lib/plot-playground.html</a>），可在线试写 Mermaid / PacketDiag 并下载图片。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"阅读区工具栏"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=ai-助手":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=ai-助手","title":"AI 助手","body":"右下角「AI 助手」按钮（或 `Ctrl+Shift+A`）打开对话面板：它会先在本地 `search-index.json` 中检索相关章节，再把资料片段与问题一起发给您配置的大模型，回答下方列出引用来源，点击即可跳转。\n\n配置入口在**左侧栏顶部的 `AI 配置` 图标**（对话面板右上角「⚙ 配置」同样可打开），包含：\n\n- **服务商与密钥**：OpenAI 兼容 / DeepSeek / Ollama 本机 / Anthropic / 自定义，填写接口地址、模型、API Key、温度、系统提示与请求方式，点「保存并测试」验证连通性\n- **资料范围**：按文件夹/文档勾选，回答只依据所选资料（不勾选 = 使用全部文档）\n- **上传文档**：可选择本机的 `.md` / `.markdown` / `.txt` 加入检索（单个 ≤ 256 KB、合计 ≤ 512 KB，仅保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会上传或提交到仓库）；上传文档会出现在资料范围的「upload://」分组中\n- API Key 只保存在浏览器 localStorage，不会写入仓库或上传服务端；公开仓库请勿把 Key 提交进任何文件\n- 请求方式默认「自动」：浏览器直连失败（通常是跨域）时自动改走本机 `serve.py` 的 `/__ai/chat` 代理（仅本机可调用）\n- 完全离线（双击 `index.html`）时检索仍可用，但调用模型需要网络，且只能直连、不能走本机代理\n- 快捷动作：「总结本页」「文档概览」「解释选中」（选中正文文字后点击）","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"AI 助手"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=数学公式":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=数学公式","title":"数学公式","body":"行内公式用 `$...$`，独立公式块用 `$$...$$`，由 KaTeX 离线渲染：\n\n行内：$a^2 + b^2 = c^2$\n\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-x^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"数学公式"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=目录约定":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=目录约定","title":"目录约定","body":"- `docs/md/` 是唯一需要维护的目录，可自由创建子文件夹\n- 图片无需登记，放在文档旁边或任意位置，用相对路径引用即可，例如 `![](images/flow.png)`；编辑器上传的图片会保存到文档同级 `images/`\n- 附件放在文档同级 `附件/`，编辑器「上传附件」会自动插入 `[文件名](附件/文件名)` 链接\n- 构建只处理 `.md` 文档；图片与附件由浏览器直接加载","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"目录约定"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=构建与预览":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=构建与预览","title":"构建与预览","body":"python setup_docsify.py\npython serve.py\n\n也可以直接双击 `docs/index.html` 浏览（file:// 模式）：`docs` 根目录只保留总览页 `index.html`，其余页面与数据在 `docs/html/`；点总览里的文件夹卡片进入 `docs/html/index_<文件夹>.html`，每个入口页都内嵌了 Markdown 与搜索快照，离线只读，保留搜索、图形、公式与下载能力。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"构建与预览"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=登录与编辑权限":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=登录与编辑权限","title":"登录与编辑权限","body":"默认 `python serve.py` 启动**认证编辑服务**（匿名可读、登录后可编辑）；`python serve.py --preview` 是只读预览，不提供任何写接口。\n\npython3 -m pip install --user --no-index --find-links server/wheels -r server/requirements.txt   # 离线包（推荐；非 root 加 --user）\npython3 -m pip install --no-index --find-links server/wheels -r server/requirements.txt            # 离线包（有写权限的账号）\npython3 -m pip install -r server/requirements.txt                                                  # 或联网安装（仅服务机需要）\npython3 serve.py                                     # Linux 推荐用 python3（3.6.8+ 全功能）\npython serve.py                                      # Windows / 默认启动认证编辑服务（配置不存在会自动生成）\npython serve.py --preview                            # 只读预览（无写接口）\npython serve.py --bind 127.0.0.1                      # 仅本机访问（默认监听所有网卡，局域网可访问）\n./start_linux.sh                                   # Linux：默认后台启动（日志 data/serve.log）\n./start_linux.sh --stop                            # 停止后台实例（按 pidfile）\n./start_linux.sh --restart                         # 强制重启：先 git pull --ff-only 更新代码，再结束占用端口的进程后启动\n./start_linux.sh --update                          # 启动前更新代码（仓库有新版功能时用它）\n./start_linux.sh --update --no-update              # 跳过代码更新（等价 MD2WEB_NO_UPDATE=1）\nMD2WEB_GIT_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7890 ./start_linux.sh --restart   # 网络受限（直连 github 被重置）时走代理更新\nMD2WEB_UPDATE_ONLY=1 ./start_linux.sh --update     # 只更新代码不启动（配合部署脚本）\nsh start_linux.sh                                   # 若报 No such file or directory（CRLF/权限）：用 sh 运行可自动去 CR\nsed -i \"s/\\r$//\" start_linux.sh && chmod +x start_linux.sh   # 或手动修复后继续用 ./start_linux.sh\n./start_linux.sh --status                          # 查看状态与进程（md2web-serve）\n./start_linux.sh --foreground                      # 前台运行（Ctrl+C 停止）\n\n> 重启/更新说明：`start_linux.sh` 只运行**当前工作区**的代码，不会自动同步远端。`--restart` 与 `--update` 会先 `git pull --ff-only` 再启动（前端生成物随提交同步，因此通常无需额外构建；`--rebuild` 可强制重建站点）。服务运行时会自动重建 `docs/`，这些生成物的本地改动会先还原、拉取后按本机配置重建，不会挡住更新。更新失败时只打印警告并继续用现有代码启动，常见原因是 `docs/` 之外的未提交改动、部署目录不是 git 工作副本，或直连 github.com 被重置——按提示走代理或先手动 `git pull`。\n\n局域网访问：服务默认监听所有网卡，启动日志会打印「局域网访问: http://<服务器IP>:8882」，同事直接用该地址即可打开；打不开时先放行防火墙端口：RHEL/CentOS 7 执行 `sudo firewall-cmd --add-port=8882/tcp --permanent && sudo firewall-cmd --reload`，Ubuntu 执行 `sudo ufw allow 8882/tcp`（启动时会检测 firewalld/ufw 并提示）。**机器有多个 IP、只有部分 IP 能打开**时按顺序查三点：① 监听地址——`ss -lntp | grep 8882` 必须是 `0.0.0.0:8882`，若显示某个具体 IP 说明 `--bind`/配置 `server.bind` 把它限死了（改成 `0.0.0.0`）；② 地址类型——只有物理网卡（`eth0`/`ens33`/`bond0`）的地址才能从外部访问，`docker0`、`virbr0`、`tun`/`br-*` 等虚拟网卡地址外部没有路由；③ firewalld 按 zone 绑网卡——`sudo firewall-cmd --get-active-zones` 列出多个 zone 时**每个 zone 都要放行**（`sudo firewall-cmd --zone=<zone> --add-port=8882/tcp --permanent && sudo firewall-cmd --reload`），只放默认 zone 会导致另一个网卡的 IP 打不开。启动横幅会列出全部可用地址并标注虚拟网卡；只监听单个 IP 时会直接提示哪些地址打不开。只允许本机使用时用 `--bind 127.0.0.1`。局域网内任何人都能看到登录页与文档，请务必修改默认管理员密码。\n\n启动后刷新页面：\n\n1. 侧栏顶部「设置」→ 用管理员账号登录（首次为 **admin / admin**，登录后请立即在窗口底部修改密码）。\n2. 在「SVN 认证路径」填入管理员准备的路由（必须是**强制账号密码认证**的路径，可点「测试认证路径」验证；允许匿名访问的路径会被拒绝）。\n3. 在「仓库映射」中填写 docs 目录与 SVN 地址（按目录段最长前缀匹配，如 `md/硬件设计` → hardware 库）。\n4. 在「默认同步凭据（SVN 账号）」中填入统一的 SVN 同步账号/密码（保存前会用认证路径校验并加密入库）：没有单独配置凭据的仓库同步时统一使用它；某个仓库需要不同账号时，在它的明细行里填写「同步账号 / 密码」并点「保存凭据」，该凭据优先于默认凭据。\n5. 按需填写「AI 助手」默认值（接口地址/模型/Key，会下发给所有登录用户），保存即可生效，无需重启。\n\n管理员打开「设置」还能看到**使用情况**（按 IP/账号的登录记录、账号使用量、用户总数、详细操作记录）与**文档统计**（每个文档的大小/更新时间/更新次数、文件夹大小、文档增删记录，点击表头可排序）。\n\n「设置 → 仓库映射」可为每个文件夹分别设置 SVN 库与**更新频率（秒）**：服务会按频率自动拉取远端更新；正在编辑（有草稿）的文档不会被覆盖，编辑器会提示先合并并可查看「远端差异」，提交成功后展示本次差异。\n\n编辑器左侧目录默认显示，点击章节会同时把源码与右侧预览定位到该处；「设置」窗口按 AI 助手 / SVN 与仓库 / 账号 / 信息查询 分 Tab 显示。\n提交时会把文档里引用的 `images/` 图片与 `附件/` 文件一起存档到 SVN（审阅面板会列出将一并提交的图片与附件）。\n\n仓库与站点结构：`docs` 根目录只保留总览页 `index.html`，其余页面与数据都在 `docs/html/`——每个文件夹一个入口页 `html/index_<文件夹或仓库名>.html`（独立搜索索引；只读/禁止合入的仓库不能提交），`html/index_all.html` 为全部文档合并视图；仓库配置在 `html/md2web_config.html`（管理员登录后可改地址、目录映射、更新频率、分组与权限，可在「默认同步凭据」统一设置同步账号或按仓库单独保存凭据，并可用「创建并拉取」自动创建目录并下载 SVN 内容）。\n\n之后：\n\n- 匿名读者仍可浏览、搜索、下载；docsify 文档页在侧栏显示「登录」，总览/配置/反馈/回收站/绘图预览等独立页在右上角显示固定的「登录」入口。\n- 编辑者用**自己的 SVN 账号密码**登录（服务端通过认证路径验证；口令先校验，成功后以本机密钥加密保存在服务端数据库，提交与查询直接复用，换密码后重新登录会自动更新；旧版 svn 客户端会回退到命令行参数传口令）。\n- 登录后打开编辑器，`Ctrl+S`（或「保存」按钮）按文档是否有 SVN 库区分：\n  - **没有 SVN 库**（所在文件夹未配置仓库，或配置为本地模式）：按钮显示「**保存到服务器**」，一步把内容写入 `docs/md` 并重建站点，关闭编辑器后页面自动刷新即可看到更新；服务器上的文件被外部改动时会提示冲突并拒绝覆盖。\n  - **有 SVN 库**：按钮显示「**本地暂存**」——保存的是带版本号的个人草稿（其他标签页或本人更新会让旧版本保存返回冲突，不会覆盖），只存在本机服务器、不会写 SVN；工具条提供「历史」（草稿版本列表，可载入任一版本）、「差异」（已发布版本 ↔ 当前草稿的统一差异）、「载入最新」「放弃草稿」。确认无误后点「**提交 SVN**」写入仓库。\n- **离开提醒**：只要还有未提交 SVN 的本地暂存（草稿），或编辑器里有未保存的修改，关闭/刷新/离开网页时浏览器会弹确认，避免辛苦编辑的内容丢失。\n- **插入图片 / 上传附件**：工具栏「上传图片」「上传附件」可多选文件，也可在源码区直接 `Ctrl+V` 粘贴剪贴板图片、把文件拖入编辑器（图片自动走 `images/`，其他文件走 `附件/`）。登录后图片保存到**当前文档同目录的 `images/`**（命名 `<文档名>-<时间戳>-<序号>.<扩展名>`）并插入引用，附件保存到同目录的 `附件/`（沿用原文件名、重名加序号）并插入 `[文件名](附件/文件名)`；`file://` 离线模式改为内嵌 data URL 或下载。\n- **文字颜色与表格**：`Ctrl+Alt+K` 打开颜色面板（生成 `<span style=\"color:…\">`，预览与站点都生效）；`Ctrl+Shift+T` 用行列选择器插入 1–8 行列的表格。\n- **查找与替换**：源码区 `Ctrl+F` 打开查找、`Ctrl+H` 打开替换；支持**大小写敏感 / 整词 / 正则**，显示命中计数，`Enter` / `F3` 跳到下一个（`Shift+Enter` / `Shift+F3` 上一个），「全部替换」一次完成，替换结果可用 `Ctrl+Z` 撤销。\n- **没有 SVN 库也能保存**：所在目录未关联仓库或为本地模式时，用「保存到服务器」直接写回 `docs/md`（草稿仅用于有 SVN 库的文档）；有 SVN 库时提交 SVN 会把新文件加入仓库。\n- **提交 SVN**：编辑器右上角「提交 SVN…」→ 填写提交说明 → 审阅面板显示目标库、精确文件与统一差异 → 点「确认提交」用**自己的 SVN 账号**提交；成功后站点会自动重建。提交只包含这篇文档，不会夹带其他文件夹或其他人的改动；远端基线过期时会明确报错而不是覆盖。「SVN 日志」可按当前账号查看目标库日志。\n- **管理员**使用本机账号（默认 `admin / admin`）登录后同样可以本地编辑；提交时提示输入一次 SVN 账号，验证通过后会加密保存到服务端数据库，后续提交可复用。\n- 会话默认 8 小时有效、闲置 30 分钟失效；服务重启后需重新登录。\n- 写接口全部经过登录 + CSRF 校验；源文件写回使用版本校验，不再有\"再次保存强制覆盖\"。\n- 修改 SVN 认证路径会让已有 SVN 用户会话失效（管理员会话保留以便继续配置）。\n\n> 阶段一（登录与只读边界）、阶段二（个人草稿、版本历史、差异）与阶段三（多库提交、私有工作副本、外部同步）已实现。工程师生成本地编辑与 SVN 提交的习惯不受影响，网站也不采集本地编辑过程。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"登录与编辑权限"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=读者反馈":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=读者反馈","title":"读者反馈","body":"侧栏 AI 设置图标旁有**反馈图标**（没有该图标的页面显示右上角固定「反馈」按钮），点击弹出反馈窗口；也可以直接打开 `html/md2web_feedback.html`：\n\n- 登录账号的读者可提交问题：标题 + 问题描述 + 相关页面；**可直接粘贴截图（`Ctrl+V`）**，或拖入/选择图片与附件——截图保存到 `docs/html/images/`、附件保存到 `docs/html/uploads/`，提交后的卡片里可直接预览缩略图、点开原图与下载附件\n- 未登录只能查看；作者本人可删除自己提交的反馈，管理员可删除任意一条并更新处理进度（待处理 / 处理中 / 已解决 / 已关闭）与处理说明，列表按状态着色\n- 反馈需要认证服务（`python serve.py`）；`file://` 离线打开只能查看，不能提交","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"读者反馈"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=界面小技巧":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=界面小技巧","title":"界面小技巧","body":"- 阅读区右上角的按钮行（复制链接 / 查看源码 / 编辑 MD / 下载 MD / 下载本页 / 显示序号）在向下滚动时会**固定在顶部**。\n- 「查看源码」无需登录：弹出窗口直接显示当前文档的 Markdown 源码，可编辑、实时预览，并「保存到本地」（不会改动服务端文档）。\n- 从搜索结果进入阅读模式时，命中工具条与按钮行会上下并排显示，互不遮挡；离开阅读模式后按钮行回到顶部。\n- 右侧「本文目录」固定**贴着窗口右缘**；其左边缘是可用鼠标拖动的调节线，向左拖变宽、向右拖变窄（宽度记忆在本机，刷新后保持）。\n- 搜索框放大镜右侧的 ⚙ 图标用于展开/收起「范围 / 模式 / 仓库」筛选（默认收起节省空间，筛选生效时图标高亮）。「仓库」是**多选**菜单：勾选一个或多个仓库后，搜索只在这些仓库里进行（可「全选/清空」，选择记忆在本机）；它与「范围」「模式」叠加生效。\n- 导出的独立 HTML 中，本文目录固定在**左侧导航**，正文在右侧滚动。目录会**高亮当前阅读的章节**并自动展开其上级；右上角有「隐藏」按钮，隐藏后屏幕右缘会出现「目录」小标签，点击即可恢复。分级标题左侧的箭头可折叠/展开子章节。\n- 绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可把左侧源码一键复制回文档；绘图示例中的每个图形都配有源码对照。\n- AI 助手面板：上传文档入口在**输入框上方**（不在配置弹窗里）；「历史」可查看与切换本机保存的历史对话，「新对话」开始一份新记录。\n- 设置入口：侧栏顶部 HOME 图标旁的单个「设置」图标（含 AI 配置）。窗口内可配置：**我的 AI 设置**（服务商/接口/模型/Key/代理策略/**参考源码路径**/资料范围，仅存本机浏览器）、**服务端设置**（管理员登录后配置 SVN 认证路径、仓库映射与全站 AI 默认值）、管理员改密。\n- 反馈入口：侧栏「设置」图标旁的反馈图标，点击弹出反馈窗口（提交问题、粘贴截图、上传附件、查看进度）；配置页/总览页等没有侧栏的页面在右上角显示固定的「反馈」按钮。\n- 文件夹视图右键菜单：在 `html/index_all.html` 的文件夹条目上右键可新建文档/新建文件夹/重命名/**移动到…**/删除（移入 `data/trash`，可找回）与设置分组（管理员）。左侧导航同样可以右键：分组标签带着真实目录，**空文件夹也会显示**，新建的子文件夹可直接右键在其中继续新建文档/子文件夹，不会落到别的目录里。\n- 文档分组与移动：来自子文件夹的文档在列表里按文件夹分组，组标题显示文件夹路径与配置分组（子文件夹继承上级仓库的分组）。「移动到…」弹窗选择本仓库内的目标文件夹（跨仓库不允许）；移动会带上该文档引用的 `images/`、`附件/` 文件——只被本文档引用就移动，被同目录其他文档也引用则保留原件并在目标目录复制一份，目标目录已有同名且内容不同的资源会跳过并提示。\n- 管理员登录：**本机管理员账号（默认 `admin / admin`）不需要 SVN 校验**，用页面右上角「登录」或设置窗口即可登录；侧栏会显示「管理员（本机）」。本机账号只能**本地编辑与保存草稿**；「提交 SVN…」时会提示输入一个 SVN 账号（仅本次合入使用，留在服务进程内存），因为仓库写入始终以真实 SVN 身份记录。\n- 首页（`#/`）由构建生成，编辑器只提供只读预览并提示改从左侧目录打开 `docs/md` 下的文档；文档路由不带 `.md`（docsify 会去掉后缀）也能正常编辑与保存。\n- 「参考源码路径」会随提问一起发给模型（如 `D:/repo/firmware` 或 `/srv/src/project`），便于 AI 回答时引用代码库位置。","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"界面小技巧"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=代码高亮":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=代码高亮","title":"代码高亮","body":"print(\"hello md2web\")","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"代码高亮"},"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=mermaid-图形":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md?id=mermaid-图形","title":"Mermaid 图形","body":"围栏语言写 `mermaid` 即渲染为图形（离线本地渲染）：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[编写 Markdown] --> B[运行构建]\n  B --> C[离线浏览与搜索]","route":"/md/使用说明/快速开始.md","pageTitle":"快速开始","headingTitle":"Mermaid 图形"},"site":"html/index_使用说明.html"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md":{"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=绘图示例":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=绘图示例","title":"绘图示例","body":"本文给出文档站支持的**全部绘图样例**：27 种 Mermaid 图形类型与 11 个 PacketDiag 模板，每个都提供「效果 + 源码」对照。源码可直接复制到 <a href=\"lib/plot-playground.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">绘图在线预览</a> 中修改后再贴回文档。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"绘图示例"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=mermaid-图形（27-种类型）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=mermaid-图形（27-种类型）","title":"Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）","body":"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"Mermaid 图形（27 种类型）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-flowchart-流程图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-flowchart-流程图","title":"1. flowchart 流程图","body":"语法要点：节点 A[文本]、判断 B{条件}、子图 subgraph\n\n效果：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]\n\n源码：\n\nflowchart LR\n  A[开始] --> B{判断}\n  B -- 是 --> C[处理]\n  B -- 否 --> D[结束]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"1. flowchart 流程图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-sequencediagram-时序图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-sequencediagram-时序图","title":"2. sequenceDiagram 时序图","body":"语法要点：participant 参与者、->> 请求、-->> 响应\n\n效果：\n\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应\n\n源码：\n\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as 用户\n  participant S as 服务\n  U->>S: 请求\n  S-->>U: 响应","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"2. sequenceDiagram 时序图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-classdiagram-类图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-classdiagram-类图","title":"3. classDiagram 类图","body":"语法要点：class 类、+属性/+方法、<|-- 继承\n\n效果：\n\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog\n\n源码：\n\nclassDiagram\n  class Animal {\n    +String name\n    +eat() void\n  }\n  class Dog {\n    +bark() void\n  }\n  Animal <|-- Dog","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"3. classDiagram 类图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-statediagram-v2-状态图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-statediagram-v2-状态图","title":"4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图","body":"语法要点：[*] 起止状态、A --> B: 事件\n\n效果：\n\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止\n\n源码：\n\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> 待机\n  待机 --> 运行: 启动\n  运行 --> 待机: 暂停\n  运行 --> [*]: 停止","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"4. stateDiagram-v2 状态图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-erdiagram-er-图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-erdiagram-er-图","title":"5. erDiagram ER 图","body":"语法要点：实体 ||--o{ 关系 : 标签、属性块\n\n效果：\n\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }\n\n源码：\n\nerDiagram\n  CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n  ORDER ||--|{ LINE_ITEM : contains\n  CUSTOMER {\n    string name\n    string email\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"5. erDiagram ER 图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-journey-用户旅程":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-journey-用户旅程","title":"6. journey 用户旅程","body":"语法要点：section 阶段、任务: 评分: 角色\n\n效果：\n\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统\n\n源码：\n\njourney\n  title 下单流程\n  section 浏览\n    打开首页: 5: 用户\n    搜索商品: 4: 用户\n  section 下单\n    加入购物车: 4: 用户\n    支付: 3: 用户, 系统","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"6. journey 用户旅程"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-gantt-甘特图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-gantt-甘特图","title":"7. gantt 甘特图","body":"语法要点：dateFormat、section、任务: 状态, id, 开始, 时长\n\n效果：\n\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d\n\n源码：\n\ngantt\n  title 项目计划\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 设计\n    需求: done, a1, 2026-01-01, 7d\n    原型: active, a2, after a1, 5d\n  section 开发\n    编码: a3, after a2, 14d","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"7. gantt 甘特图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-pie-饼图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-pie-饼图","title":"8. pie 饼图","body":"语法要点：pie title、\"标签\" : 数值\n\n效果：\n\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25\n\n源码：\n\npie title 流量分布\n  \"视频\" : 45\n  \"网页\" : 30\n  \"下载\" : 25","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"8. pie 饼图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-quadrantchart-四象限":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-quadrantchart-四象限","title":"9. quadrantChart 四象限","body":"语法要点：x-axis/y-axis、quadrant-1..4、数据点 [x, y]\n\n效果：\n\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]\n\n源码：\n\nquadrantChart\n  title 优先级评估\n  x-axis 低收益 --> 高收益\n  y-axis 低成本 --> 高成本\n  quadrant-1 优先做\n  quadrant-2 计划做\n  quadrant-3 少做\n  quadrant-4 避免\n  需求A: [0.7, 0.3]\n  需求B: [0.3, 0.6]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"9. quadrantChart 四象限"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-requirementdiagram-需求图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-requirementdiagram-需求图","title":"10. requirementDiagram 需求图","body":"语法要点：requirement { id/text/risk/verifymethod }、element、关系；文本值需加引号\n\n效果：\n\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login\n\n源码：\n\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement login {\n    id: 1\n    text: \"支持账号密码登录\"\n    risk: medium\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element login_module {\n    type: module\n  }\n  login_module - satisfies -> login","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"10. requirementDiagram 需求图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-gitgraph-提交图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-gitgraph-提交图","title":"11. gitGraph 提交图","body":"语法要点：commit、branch、checkout、merge\n\n效果：\n\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop\n\n源码：\n\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"init\"\n  branch develop\n  commit id: \"feat\"\n  checkout main\n  merge develop","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"11. gitGraph 提交图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_12-mindmap-思维导图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_12-mindmap-思维导图","title":"12. mindmap 思维导图","body":"语法要点：root((中心)) 与缩进层级\n\n效果：\n\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用\n\n源码：\n\nmindmap\n  root((产品))\n    功能\n      搜索\n      导出\n    体验\n      速度\n      易用","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"12. mindmap 思维导图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_13-timeline-时间线":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_13-timeline-时间线","title":"13. timeline 时间线","body":"语法要点：标题、时间 : 事件 : 事件\n\n效果：\n\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划\n\n源码：\n\ntimeline\n  title 版本历史\n  2024 : v1.0 发布\n  2025 : v2.0 发布 : 性能优化\n  2026 : v3.0 规划","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"13. timeline 时间线"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_14-sankey-桑基图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_14-sankey-桑基图","title":"14. sankey 桑基图","body":"语法要点：CSV 三列：来源,目标,数值\n\n效果：\n\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8\n\n源码：\n\nsankey-beta\n\nA,B,10\nA,C,5\nB,D,8","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"14. sankey 桑基图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_15-xychart-xy-图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_15-xychart-xy-图","title":"15. xychart XY 图","body":"语法要点：x-axis 分类、y-axis 范围、bar/line 数据\n\n效果：\n\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]\n\n源码：\n\nxychart-beta\n  title \"月度访问量\"\n  x-axis [\"1月\", \"2月\", \"3月\", \"4月\"]\n  y-axis \"访问量\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [320, 480, 640, 900]\n  line [300, 500, 700, 950]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"15. xychart XY 图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_16-block-块图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_16-block-块图","title":"16. block 块图","body":"语法要点：columns 列数、块定义、--> 连线\n\n效果：\n\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C\n\n源码：\n\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  A[\"输入\"] B[\"处理\"] C[\"输出\"]\n  A --> B\n  B --> C","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"16. block 块图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_17-packet-报文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_17-packet-报文图","title":"17. packet 报文图","body":"语法要点：packet-beta、位范围: \"字段\"\n\n效果：\n\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"\n\n源码：\n\npacket-beta\n  0-15: \"源端口\"\n  16-31: \"目的端口\"\n  32-63: \"序列号\"\n  64-95: \"确认号\"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"17. packet 报文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_18-architecture-架构图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_18-architecture-架构图","title":"18. architecture 架构图","body":"语法要点：group/service(icon)[标题]、:L -- R: 连线\n\n效果：\n\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server\n\n源码：\n\narchitecture-beta\n  group api(cloud)[API 层]\n  service db(database)[数据库] in api\n  service server(server)[服务] in api\n  db:L -- R:server","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"18. architecture 架构图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_19-c4-上下文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_19-c4-上下文图","title":"19. C4 上下文图","body":"语法要点：Person/System/Rel 声明\n\n效果：\n\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")\n\n源码：\n\nC4Context\n  title 系统上下文\n  Person(user, \"用户\", \"使用系统\")\n  System(sys, \"系统\", \"提供能力\")\n  Rel(user, sys, \"使用\")","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"19. C4 上下文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_20-kanban-看板":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_20-kanban-看板","title":"20. kanban 看板","body":"语法要点：列[标题] 与缩进任务[描述]\n\n效果：\n\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]\n\n源码：\n\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    task1[任务一]\n    task2[任务二]\n  doing[进行中]\n    task3[任务三]\n  done[已完成]\n    task4[任务四]","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"20. kanban 看板"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_21-radar-雷达图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_21-radar-雷达图","title":"21. radar 雷达图","body":"语法要点：axis id[\"维度\"]、curve id[\"名称\"]{数值}、max 上限\n\n效果：\n\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100\n\n源码：\n\nradar-beta\n  title 方案对比\n  axis perf[\"性能\"], cost[\"成本\"], ease[\"易用\"], eco[\"生态\"]\n  curve a[\"方案A\"]{80, 60, 70, 50}\n  curve b[\"方案B\"]{60, 80, 50, 70}\n  max 100","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"21. radar 雷达图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_22-treemap-矩形树图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_22-treemap-矩形树图","title":"22. treemap 矩形树图","body":"语法要点：层级标题 + \"叶子\": 数值\n\n效果：\n\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15\n\n源码：\n\ntreemap-beta\n\"根目录\"\n  \"文档\": 30\n  \"源码\"\n    \"前端\": 20\n    \"后端\": 25\n  \"测试\": 15","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"22. treemap 矩形树图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_23-wardley-战略图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_23-wardley-战略图","title":"23. wardley 战略图","body":"语法要点：anchor/component 名称 [可见度, 演进度]、-> 依赖（名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database\n\n源码：\n\nwardley-beta\n  title Technology Evolution\n  anchor User [0.95, 0.35]\n  component System [0.7, 0.5]\n  component Database [0.6, 0.75]\n  User -> System\n  System -> Database","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"23. wardley 战略图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_24-cynefin-决策域":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_24-cynefin-决策域","title":"24. cynefin 决策域","body":"语法要点：complex/complicated/clear/chaotic/confusion 与条目\n\n效果：\n\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"\n\n源码：\n\ncynefin-beta\n  title 决策域\n  complex\n    \"探索未知\"\n  complicated\n    \"专家分析\"\n  clear\n    \"标准流程\"\n  chaotic\n    \"紧急响应\"\n  confusion\n    \"待归类\"","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"24. cynefin 决策域"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_25-eventmodeling-事件建模":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_25-eventmodeling-事件建模","title":"25. eventmodeling 事件建模","body":"语法要点：tf 序号 类型 名称（ui/cmd/evt/readmodel 等，名称需 ASCII）\n\n效果：\n\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView\n\n源码：\n\neventmodeling\n\ntf 01 ui CartUI\ntf 02 cmd AddItem\ntf 03 evt ItemAdded\ntf 04 readmodel CartView","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"25. eventmodeling 事件建模"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_26-treeview-目录树":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_26-treeview-目录树","title":"26. treeView 目录树","body":"语法要点：treeView-beta 与缩进层级（带 / 为目录）\n\n效果：\n\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md\n\n源码：\n\ntreeView-beta\n    my-project/\n        src/\n            index.js\n        package.json\n        README.md","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"26. treeView 目录树"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_27-info-版本信息":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_27-info-版本信息","title":"27. info 版本信息","body":"语法要点：仅显示 Mermaid 版本\n\n效果：\n\ninfo\n\n源码：\n\ninfo\n\n> 未包含的实验类型（如 `venn`、`ishikawa`、`railroad-*`、`flowchart-elk`）在当前 Mermaid 版本下不稳定或需要额外插件，绘图预览页的下拉框中亦未收录。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"27. info 版本信息"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=packetdiag-报文图":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=packetdiag-报文图","title":"PacketDiag 报文图","body":"围栏语言写 `packetdiag`，使用标准 [packetdiag](http://blockdiag.com/en/nwdiag/packetdiag-examples.html) 语法；字段格式为 `bit[-end]: 标签 [选项]`。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"PacketDiag 报文图"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-默认-64-字节报文（packet）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_1-默认-64-字节报文（packet）","title":"1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 40;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- 基础头部 (Base Header: Word 0 ~ Word 7) ----\n\n    // Word 0\n    0-31: HOST_MAC;\n\n    // Word 1\n    32-47: HOST_MAC;\n    48-63: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 2\n    64-95: NP_MAC;\n\n    // Word 3\n    96-111: \"0x8100\";\n    112-127: VLAN;\n\n    // Word 4\n    128-143: \"Ethernet Type\";\n    144-151: \"Message Length\";\n    152-153: R;\n    154: NS_E;\n    155-159: R;\n\n    // Word 5\n    160-167: \"Message Type\";\n    168-175: DISP_REG;\n    176-179: DST_CHAIN_ID [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    180-191: VRF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n\n    // Word 6\n    192-202: L2_IIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    203: R;\n    204-215: L2_EIF [textcolor = \"red\"];\n    216-223: \"TimeStamp[37:30]\";\n\n    // Word 7\n    224: R;\n    225-255: \"TimeStamp[29:0]\";\n\n    // ---- 复用变体部分 (Alternatives for Word 8) ----\n  \n    // 变体 1: BFD上送\n    256-287: \"BFD Discriminator\" [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 2: MOD上送\n    288-311: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    312-319: DISCARD_COUNTER_IDX [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n\n    // 变体 3: MAC地址学习\n    320: VP_V [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    321: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    322-327: VP [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    328-337: R [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n    338-351: VFI [color = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"1. 默认 64 字节报文（packet）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-tcp-头部（tcp）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_2-tcp-头部（tcp）","title":"2. TCP 头部（tcp）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 72;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- TCP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-63: Sequence Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    64-95: Acknowledgment Number [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    96-99: Data Offset [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    100-105: Reserved [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    106: URG [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    107: ACK [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    108: PSH [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    109: RST [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    110: SYN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    111: FIN [rotate = 270, color = \"#fce7f3\"];\n    112-127: Window [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    128-143: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    144-159: Urgent Pointer [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    160-191: \"Options and Padding\" [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    192-223: data [colheight = 3, color = \"#ccfbf1\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"2. TCP 头部（tcp）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-ipv4-头部（ipv4）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_3-ipv4-头部（ipv4）","title":"3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 54;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- IPv4 Header ----\n    0-3: Version [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    4-7: IHL [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    8-13: DSCP [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    14-15: ECN [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    16-31: Total Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    32-47: Identification [color = \"#ede9fe\"];\n    48-50: Flags [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    51-63: Fragment Offset [color = \"#fef9c3\"];\n    64-71: TTL [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    72-79: Protocol [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n    80-95: Header Checksum [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    96-127: Source Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n    128-159: Destination Address [color = \"#e0f2fe\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"3. IPv4 头部（ipv4）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-udp-头部（udp）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_4-udp-头部（udp）","title":"4. UDP 头部（udp）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 60;\n    default_fontsize = 13;\n\n    // ---- UDP Header ----\n    0-15: Source Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    16-31: Destination Port [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    32-47: Length [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    48-63: Checksum [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"4. UDP 头部（udp）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-以太网帧头（ethernet）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_5-以太网帧头（ethernet）","title":"5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 52;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    // ---- Ethernet Frame ----\n    0-7: Preamble [color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n    8-15: SFD [color = \"#d1d5db\"];\n    16-63: Destination MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    64-111: Source MAC [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n    112-127: EtherType [color = \"#dcfce7\"];\n    128-159: Payload [color = \"#fef3c7\"];\n    160-191: FCS [color = \"#fee2e2\"];\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"5. 以太网帧头（ethernet）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-标准示例（standard）":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_6-标准示例（standard）","title":"6. 标准示例（standard）","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n    colwidth = 32;\n    node_height = 58;\n    default_fontsize = 12;\n\n    # === Demo: Full Standard PacketDiag Compatibility ===\n    # This example exercises ALL standard syntax features\n\n    # ---- Standard Field Attributes ----\n\n    # 1. label attribute — display alias\n    0-7: type [label = \"Type\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 2. number attribute — hide bit badge\n    8-15: code [label = \"Code\", color = \"#dcfce7\", number = 0];\n\n    # 3. style & shape — border and cell shape\n    16-19: chksum [label = \"Checksum\", color = \"#fef3c7\", style = \"dashed\"];\n    20-23: rsvd [label = \"Reserved\", color = \"#ede9fe\", style = \"dotted\"];\n\n    # 4. description — hover tooltip\n    24-31: ident [label = \"Identifier\", color = \"#fee2e2\", description = \"Unique flow identifier assigned by the source\"];\n\n    # 5. shape = ellipse\n    32-47: payload [label = \"Payload\", color = \"#ccfbf1\", shape = \"ellipse\"];\n\n    # 6. len — variable-length field (jagged right edge)\n    48-63: data [label = \"Var Data\", color = \"#ffedd5\", len = 64];\n\n    # 7. background — override cell background\n    64-79: flags [background = \"#c7d2fe\", label = \"Flags\", description = \"Control flags bitmap\"];\n\n    # 8. icon & rotate\n    80: F [label = \"F\", rotate = 270, icon = \"flag\"];\n    81: S [label = \"S\", rotate = 270, icon = \"sync\"];\n    82: R [label = \"R\", rotate = 270];\n    83-95: unused [label = \"Unused\", style = \"none\", color = \"#e5e7eb\"];\n\n    # 9. Sparse packet — gaps show dotted empty areas\n    100-107: gap_fill [label = \"After Gap\", color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n\n    # 10. scale config\n    scale_direction = \"left_to_right\";\n    scale_interval = 8;\n\n    # ---- Description Table ----\n    desctable {\n      type = \"Packet type identifier\"\n      code = \"Operation code (request/response)\"\n      ident = \"Flow identifier\"\n      payload = \"Data payload (variable length)\"\n      data = \"Variable-length data field\"\n      flags = \"Control flags bitmap\"\n    }\n  }","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"6. 标准示例（standard）"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-扩展：位序反转-bit_order-desc":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_7-扩展：位序反转-bit_order-desc","title":"7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  bit_order = \"desc\";\n\n  28-31: Version;\n  24-27: IHL;\n  16-23: TOS;\n  0-15: Total Length;\n  32-47: Identification;\n  48-63: Flags + Fragment Offset;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"7. 扩展：位序反转 (bit_order = desc)"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-扩展：按行编号-numbering-local":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_8-扩展：按行编号-numbering-local","title":"8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n  numbering = \"local\";\n\n  0-15: Word0 High;\n  16-31: Word0 Low;\n  // @row: Word 1\n  0-31: Word1;\n  // @row: Word 2\n  0-7: Byte 0;\n  8-15: Byte 1;\n  16-23: Byte 2;\n  24-31: Byte 3;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"8. 扩展：按行编号 (numbering = local)"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-扩展：区段-row-left-注释":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_9-扩展：区段-row-left-注释","title":"9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  // ---- 请求头 ----\n  // @left: 固定 8 字节\n  0-31: Magic;\n  32-63: Length;\n  // @row: 负载\n  // @left: 可变长\n  64-79: Type;\n  80-95: Flags;\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"9. 扩展：区段 / @row / @left 注释"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-扩展：desctable-描述表":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_10-扩展：desctable-描述表","title":"10. 扩展：desctable 描述表","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 44;\n\n  0-15: SrcPort [description = \"源端口\"];\n  16-31: DstPort [description = \"目的端口\"];\n  32-63: Seq [description = \"序列号\"];\n\n  desctable {\n    SrcPort = \"发送方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    DstPort = \"接收方端口号（16 bits）\"\n    Seq = \"本报文段数据第一个字节的序号\"\n  }\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"10. 扩展：desctable 描述表"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-扩展：字段属性演示":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=_11-扩展：字段属性演示","title":"11. 扩展：字段属性演示","body":"效果：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}\n\n源码：\n\npacketdiag {\n  colwidth = 32;\n  node_height = 52;\n\n  0-3: Ver [color = \"#dbeafe\"];\n  4-7: IHL [textcolor = \"red\"];\n  8-15: TOS [background = \"#fce5cd\"];\n  16-31: Len [rotate = 270];\n  32-47: Flags [icon = \"flag\"];\n  48-63: Dash [style = \"dashed\"];\n  64-95: Payload [len = 64];\n  96-127: Shape [shape = \"ellipse\"];\n}","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"11. 扩展：字段属性演示"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=常用选项":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=常用选项","title":"常用选项","body":"| 选项 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `color` | 填充色 | `[color = \"#dbeafe\"]` |\n| `textcolor` | 文字色 | `[textcolor = \"red\"]` |\n| `rotate` | 标签旋转 90/270 | `[rotate = 270]` |\n| `colheight` | 高度倍数 1–12 | `[colheight = 3]` |\n| `label` | 显示名 | `[label = \"Src Port\"]` |\n| `description` | 生成字段说明表 | `[description = \"RFC 793\"]` |\n| `style` | 边框样式 | `[style = \"dashed\"]` |","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"常用选项"},"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=全局配置与增强语法":{"slug":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md?id=全局配置与增强语法","title":"全局配置与增强语法","body":"| 语法 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `colwidth = 32;` | 每列宽度 |\n| `node_height = 48;` | 行高 |\n| `default_fontsize = 12;` | 默认字号 |\n| `scale_interval = 10;` | 位标尺间隔 |\n| `numbering = \"global\"` / `\"local\"` | 全局编号 / 按行编号 |\n| `bit_order = \"desc\"` | 位序反转（配合升序范围使用） |\n| `// @row: 名称` | 按行分段标题 |\n| `// @left: 文本` | 左侧注释 |\n| `desctable { 名称 = \"说明\" }` | 字段说明表 |\n\n> 图形均可点击放大查看；Mermaid 支持下载 SVG / PNG，PacketDiag 支持下载 PNG。绘图预览页提供「复制源码」按钮，可一键把源码复制回文档；阅读区右上角的「下载本页」可把当前文档导出为独立 HTML 文件。","route":"/md/使用说明/绘图示例.md","pageTitle":"绘图示例","headingTitle":"全局配置与增强语法"},"site":"html/index_使用说明.html"}}};
